-module___MJ_GW__goToWrapper\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-row ant-form-item-row\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-col ant-form-item-label\">\u003Clabel class=\"ant-form-item-required\" title=\"Complete Advanced KYC Verification\">Complete Advanced KYC Verification\u003C/label>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-col ant-form-item-control\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item-control-input\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item-control-input-content\">\u003Cp class=\"styles-module-scss-module___MJ_GW__desc styles-module-scss-module___MJ_GW__descColor\">The Advanced KYC review result will be returned in about 5–10 minutes. Please refresh this page then to continue submitting your application.\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"styles-module-scss-module___MJ_GW__goToButtonWrap\">\u003Cdiv class=\"styles-module-scss-module___MJ_GW__goToFormWrapper styles-module-scss-module___MJ_GW__advancedKyc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ant-tag-v2 ant-tag-v2-type-default ant-tag-v2-success mx-size-md styles-module-scss-module___MJ_GW__statusTag\">\u003Csvg class=\"mx-icon\" focusable=\"false\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" data-icon=\"CheckCircleFilled\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\">\u003Cpath d=\"M512 1024A512 512 0 1 0 512 0a512 512 0 0 0 0 1024z m262.729143-624.64l-256 329.142857a54.857143 54.857143 0 0 1-82.066286 5.12l-146.285714-146.285714a54.857143 54.857143 0 0 1 77.531428-77.531429l102.4 102.326857 217.819429-280.137142a54.857143 54.857143 0 0 1 86.601143 67.364571z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003Cspan class=\"ant-tag-v2-content\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-divider ant-divider-horizontal\" role=\"separator\">\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__submitItem\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__descLabel styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__formItemNoStyle\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-row ant-form-item-row\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-col ant-form-item-label\">\u003Clabel class=\"ant-form-item-required\" title=\"Proof of Address\">Proof of Address\u003C/label>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-col ant-form-item-control\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item-control-input\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item-control-input-content\">\u003Cp class=\"styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__desc styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__itemDesc\">\u003Cp>Provide a proof-of-address document issued within the past 6 months and in your name to verify your residential address. Select the applicable document type to view the submission requirements.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Document Requirements:\u003Cbr>1. The document must clearly show your name and address.\u003Cbr>2. Remove any password protection before uploading the document.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Important Note\u003Cbr>If the document is not in your name, such as when living with your parents or spouse, also provide proof of your relationship, such as a household registration document or marriage certificate, and explain the situation in the remarks.\u003C/p>\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__submitItem styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__fileUploadSection\">\u003Cdiv class=\"styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__verifyComplexWrapper styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__advancedKycItem styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__relatedItemWrapper\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__select styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__textInput\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-row ant-form-item-row\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-col ant-form-item-control\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item-control-input\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item-control-input-content\">\u003Cdiv class=\"mx-motion-select-v2-container mx-motion-focus-border-enabled\" style=\"--spotlight-rx: var(--mx-motion-input-spotlight-rx-hover); --spotlight-ry: var(--mx-motion-input-spo