le-scss-module__MLXwla__multiFile\">\u003Cspan class=\"ant-upload-picture-card-wrapper components-module-scss-module__MLXwla__columnCenter components-module-scss-module__MLXwla__uploadWrapper\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-upload ant-upload-select ant-upload-select-picture-card\">\u003Cspan tabindex=\"0\" class=\"ant-upload\" role=\"button\">\u003Cinput accept=\".jpg,.jpeg,.png,.pdf\" type=\"file\" style=\"display: none;\">\u003Cdiv class=\"components-module-scss-module__MLXwla__columnCenter\">\u003Csvg class=\"mx-icon components-module-scss-module__MLXwla__plusIcon\" focusable=\"false\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"PlusOutlined\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\">\u003Cpath fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13 3C13 2.44772 12.5523 2 12 2C11.4477 2 11 2.44772 11 3V11H3C2.44772 11 2 11.4477 2 12C2 12.5523 2.44772 13 3 13H11V21C11 21.5523 11.4477 22 12 22C12.5523 22 13 21.5523 13 21V13H21C21.5523 13 22 12.5523 22 12C22 11.4477 21.5523 11 21 11H13V3Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003Cp>Upload or paste here\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-row ant-form-item-row\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-col ant-form-item-control\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item-control-input\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item-control-input-content\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-input-textarea ant-input-textarea-show-count ant-input-textarea-in-form-item styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__complexTextArea\" data-count=\"0 / 300\">\u003Ctextarea rows=\"2\" id=\"requiredItemId-157-textArea\" aria-required=\"true\" class=\"ant-input\">\u003C/textarea>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-divider ant-divider-horizontal styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__divider\" role=\"separator\">\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__submitItem\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__descLabel styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__formItemNoStyle\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-row ant-form-item-row\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-col ant-form-item-label\">\u003Clabel class=\"ant-form-item-required\" title=\"Proof of Source of Last 1-2 Deposits\">Proof of Source of Last 1-2 Deposits\u003C/label>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-col ant-form-item-control\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item-control-input\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item-control-input-content\">\u003Cp class=\"styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__desc styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__itemDesc\">\u003Cp>1. Provide proof of the source of funds for your 1–2 most recent deposits.\u003Cbr>2. Explain:\u003Cbr>• Source of funds: Who sent the funds, whether from you or another person, and the originating wallet or platform.\u003Cbr>• Deposit purpose: Why the funds were deposited to MEXC, such as Spot trading, Futures trading, or MEXC Earn.\u003Cbr>See the \u003Ca href=\"https://www.mexc.co/learn/article/account-risk-review-guide/2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Account Risk Review Guide\u003C/a> for details.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Important Notes\u003Cbr>1. Upload a screenshot of the transfer record showing the asset, amount, time, and TxID (transaction hash), such as a withdrawal record from another platform to MEXC.\u003Cbr>2. If you made only one deposit in the past 90 days, provide proof for that deposit only.\u003Cbr>3. If you made no deposits in the past 90 days, provide proof for any previous deposit. Click \"\u003Ca href=\"https://www.mexc.co/support/data-export\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Account Data Export\u003C/a>\" to view your records.\u003Cbr>4. If your account has only received fiat deposits and has never received an on-chain deposit or internal transfer, select \"Other Special Circumstances,\" explain the source of funds, and upload a screenshot of the fiat order record.\u003Cbr>\u003C/p>\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__submitItem styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__fileUploadSection\">\u003Cdiv class=\"styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__verifyComplexWrapper styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__advancedKycItem styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__relatedItemWrapper\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__select styles-module-scss-module__VQR4fa__textInput\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-row ant-form-item-row\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-col ant-form-item-control\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item-control-input\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-form-item-control-input-content\">\u003Cdiv class=\"mx-motion-select-v2-container mx-motion-focus-border-enabled\" style=\"--spotlight-rx: var(--mx-motion-input-spotlight-rx-default); --spotlight-ry: var(--mx-motion-input-spotlight-ry); --mx-motion-input-height: var(--height-base); --mx-motion-radius: var(--select-border-radius, 8px); width: 100%;\">\u003Cdiv class=\"mx-motion-spotlight-bg\">\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"mx-motion-spotlight mx-motion-spotlight-fill\" style=\"opacity: 0;\">\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"mx-motion-spotlight mx-motion-spotlight-border\" style=\"opacity: 0;\">\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"mx-motion-focus-border\">\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-select-v2 ant-select-v2-in-form-item ant-select-v2-single ant-select-v2-show-arrow\" aria-required=\"true\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ant-select-v2-selector\">\u003Cspan class=\"ant-select-v2-selection-search\">\u003Cinput id=\"requiredItemId-78-relatedSelect\" autocomplete=\"off\" class=\"ant-select-v2-selection-search-input\" role=\"combobox\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-owns=\"requiredItemId-78-relatedSelect_list\" aria-autocomplete=\"list\" aria-controls=\"requiredItemId-78-relatedSelect_list\" aria-activedescendant=\"requiredItemI