mportant_info_1\\\":\\\"1. Account deletion is permanent and irreversible. You will immediately lose all data, including trading history, and account access.\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_important_info_2\\\":\\\"2. Some data may be retained after account deletion, such as transaction records shared with other parties, which may remain viewable to relevant users.\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_important_info_3\\\":\\\"3. Your personal information may be retained in accordance with law enforcement requirements. Rest assured, protecting your data is our top priority. For more details on how we handle your data, please refer to our Terms of Use and Privacy Policy (\\u003clink\\u003e{url}\\u003c/link\\u003e).\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_important_info_agree\\\":\\\"I have read and agree to the above terms\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_warm_tips\\\":\\\"Reminder\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_current_asset_title\\\":\\\"Your current account holds the following assets:\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_total_asset\\\":\\\"Total Assets: {asset} USDT\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_asset_detail\\\":\\\"View Asset Details\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_agree_forfeit_asset\\\":\\\"I agree to forfeit all remaining assets in this account and confirm that I fully waive and release all claims. I will not make any claims against MEXC regarding the account closure or the forfeiture of the remaining balance.\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_account_countdown_day\\\":\\\"The account will be permanently deleted in {day} day(s)\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_account_countdown_hour\\\":\\\"The account will be permanently deleted in {hour} hour(s)\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_final_notice_title\\\":\\\"Friendly Reminder\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_completed_info_1\\\":\\\"1. Your account is still fully functional at this time.\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_completed_info_2\\\":\\\"2. You may choose to cancel the deletion request before it is completed. Once canceled, your account will remain active and accessible.\\\",\\