.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_applying_button\\\":\\\"Check Now\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_facial_recognition_desc\\\":\\\"Please complete facial recognition to confirm your identity\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_start_facial_recognition\\\":\\\"Start Facial Recognition\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_facial_recognition_warning\\\":\\\"Facial recognition required\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_verify_desc\\\":\\\"Please follow the system instructions to upload your ID and facial scan\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_verify_button_text\\\":\\\"Verify\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_verify_error_text\\\":\\\"Complete KYC Verification\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_facial_recognition_reason_desc\\\":\\\"Please complete facial recognition whenever possible. This alternative document type does not guarantee approval of your document review application.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_facial_recognition_reason_required\\\":\\\"Please specify why you cannot complete facial recognition\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_complete_kyc\\\":\\\"Complete Advanced KYC Verification\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_complete_kyc_desc\\\":\\\"The Advanced KYC review result will be returned in about 5–10 minutes. Please refresh this page then to continue submitting your application.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_go_to_kyc_button\\\":\\\"Proceed to Advanced KYC\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_complete_kyc_required\\\":\\\"Please complete Advanced KYC verification\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_advanced_kyc_failure_reason\\\":\\\"Reason for Not Completing Advanced KYC Verification\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_advanced_kyc_warning\\\":\\\"Note: If Advanced KYC Verification is not completed, submitting only a handheld ID photo does not guarantee review approval. You are advised to complete Advanced Identity Verification.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_advanced_kyc_reason_required\\\":\\\"This field is required\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_data\\\":\\\"Risk Review Documents\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_completed\\\":\\\"Completed\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_facial_recognition_blacked\\\":\\\"This account is currently not eligible for facial recognition.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_facial_recognition_switch_to_complete\\\":\\\"Switch Back to Facial Recognition\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_cannot_complete_facial_recognition_modal_title\\\":\\\"Unable to Complete Facial Recognition\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_facial_recognition_switch_to_reason\\\":\\\"Switch Method\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_facial_recognition_continue\\\":\\\"Continue Facial Recognition\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_cannot_complete_facial_recognition_modal_desc_aai_verify\\\":\\\"If you're unable to complete facial recognition, you can verify your identity by submitting ID photos and a facial scan\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_cannot_complete_facial_recognition_modal_desc\\\":\\\"If you are unable to complete facial recognition, you may switch to submitting a handheld ID photo as a document item.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_cannot_complete_facial_recognition_notify\\\":\\\"Trouble completing facial recognition?\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_advanced_kyc_reason_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter the reason for not completing Advanced KYC verification\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_advanced_kyc_switch_to_complete\\\":\\\"Switch to Advanced KYC Verification\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_advanced_kyc_alternative_option_aai_verify\\\":\\\"If you're unable to complete Advanced KYC Verification, you can verify your identity by submitting ID photos and a facial scan\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_advanced_kyc_alternative_option\\\":\\\"If you are unable to complete Advanced KYC Verification, you may switch to submitting a handheld ID photo as a document item.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_advanced_kyc_cannot_complete_notify\\\":\\\"Unable to Complete Advanced KYC Verification?\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_complete_bind_mobile\\\":\\\"Complete Mobile Verification Linking\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_complete_bind_mobile_desc\\\":\\\"After completing mobile verification and linking, please return to this page to continue submitting your application.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_complete_bind_mobile_required\\\":\\\"Please link your mobile number for verification\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_go_to_bind_mobile_button\\\":\\\"Link Mobile for Verification\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_bind_mobile_cannot_complete_notify\\\":\\\"Unable to link mobile number?\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_bind_mobile_complete\\\":\\\"Linked\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_bind_mobile_reason_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please provide the reason why the mobile number cannot be linked\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_bind_mobile_switch_to_complete\\\":\\\"Switch to mobile verification\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_format_desc\\\":\\\"Instructions:\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_apply_form_hint\\\":\\\"Please read the following requirements carefully and submit the corresponding documents. Thank you for your cooperation.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_apply_form_hint_link1\\\":\\\"View \\u003clink\\u003eAccount Risk Review-Account Risk Review Guide\\u003c/link\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_apply_form_hint_link2\\\":\\\"View the MEXC Risk Control Guidelines:\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_apply_form_email\\\":\\\"Contactable Email\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_apply_form_email_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please enter contactable email\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_apply_form_email_code\\\":\\\"Email Verification Code\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_apply_form_email_code_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please enter email verification code\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_apply_form_send_email_code\\\":\\\"Get Code\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_country\\\":\\\"Nationality\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_country_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please select the country you are located in\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_x_desc\\\":\\\"Please provide your current X account, and ensure the information is accurate and valid so we can contact you if needed. If you don’t have an X account, please enter \\\\\\\"N/A\\\\\\\" and submit.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_x_desc_1\\\":\\\"X Account ID: Use the format @xxxxx (must include the @ symbol)\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_x_desc_2\\\":\\\"X Account URL: Enter the full link, e.g. https://x.com/xxx\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_safety_hint\\\":\\\"To protect your account, if anyone contacts you claiming to be from MEXC, you can verify their identity through the \\u003clink\\u003eMEXC Verify\\u003c/link\\u003e. Please also avoid disclosing any sensitive account information to prevent unnecessary risks or asset loss.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_x_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please enter your X (Twitter) account\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_telegram_desc\\\":\\\"Please provide your current Telegram account, and ensure the information is accurate and valid so we can contact you if needed. If you don’t have a Telegram account, please enter “N/A\\\\\\\" and submit.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_telegram_desc_1\\\":\\\"Telegram Account ID: Use the format @xxxxx (must include the @ symbol)\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_telegram_desc_2\\\":\\\"Telegram Account URL: Enter the full link, e.g. http://t.me/xxx\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_telegram_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please enter your Telegram account\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_submit_apply\\\":\\\"Submit Application\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_advanced_kyc_cannot_complete\\\":\\\"Unable to Complete Advanced KYC Verification\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_advanced_kyc_switch\\\":\\\"Switch Method\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_advanced_kyc_continue\\\":\\\"Proceed with Advanced KYC Verification\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_submit_success_title\\\":\\\"Application submitted successfully. The reviewer is expected to complete the preliminary review and provide feedback within {days} business days.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_modal_title\\\":\\\"Confirm Application Details\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_modal_back_to_edit\\\":\\\"Back to Edit\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_modal_submit\\\":\\\"Submit Application\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_modal_message\\\":\\\"Please check that the details you have entered are accurate.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_modal_content_1\\\":\\\"1. The details you provided meet the requirements.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_modal_content_2_1\\\":\\\"2. The uploaded images are complete and clearly visible.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_modal_content_2_2\\\":\\\"Please ensure the above information is accurate so that we can review your submitted documents as soon as possible.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aduit_finish_title\\\":\\\"Concluded\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aduit_not_pass_subtitle2\\\":\\\"Reason for Rejection: \\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_record_modal_title\\\":\\\"Account Risk Review Application Details\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_record_apply_time\\\":\\\"Application Time\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_record_update_time\\\":\\\"Update Time\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_go_check_progress\\\":\\\"Check the Latest Progress\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_record_title\\\":\\\"Account Risk Review History\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_record_progessing\\\":\\\"In Progress\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aduit_resubmit_subtitle\\\":\\\"Please click the button below and resubmit the required documents as instructed on the page.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_bind_mobile_cannot_complete\\\":\\\"Unable to link mobile number\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_bind_mobile_switch\\\":\\\"Unable to link device\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_bind_mobile_continue\\\":\\\"Continue with mobile verification\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_common_reminder\\\":\\\"Important notice:\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_bind_mobile_failure_tip\\\":\\\"If you are unable to link your phone number, please state the reason on the document submission page. To help us review your account documents smoothly, please complete phone number linking whenever possible.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_audit_need_supplementary_title\\\":\\\"Please Submit Supplementary Information\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_audit_need_supplementary_subtitle\\\":\\\"The documents you submitted currently do not meet the review requirements. Please continue to submit supplementary documents.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aduit_not_pass_title\\\":\\\"The information did not pass the review. Please resubmit.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aduit_pass_subtitle2\\\":\\\"Please wait patiently. Thank you for your understanding.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aduit_pass_hint1\\\":\\\"The estimated time is for reference only and reflects the current risk analysis result only.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aduit_pass_hint\\\":\\\"In special cases, your account status may change. Please refer to the actual account status. If you have any questions, please contact Customer Service.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_holding_id_photo_and_desc_hint1\\\":\\\"Please take a photo of you holding both the ID and the written description with your face shown. Make sure the information on the ID is clear and visible.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_holding_id_photo_and_desc_hint2\\\":\\\"Content to be written on the case description paper: MEXC account or UID and application date\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_proof_of_source_funds_hint\\\":\\\"Kindly provide proof of funding source for your account. You can refer to the \\u003cButton\\u003e\\\\\\\"Proof of Funding Source FAQ\\\\\\\"\\u003c/Button\\u003e for more information. If you have any questions, please contact our online Customer Service.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_supplementary_upload_income_proof_hint\\\":\\\"Please provide details of your current occupation and income proof for the past 6 months (such as bank statements, payroll, etc.).\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_supplementary_upload_tax_record_hint\\\":\\\"Please provide the tax filing records for the past 3 fiscal years.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_apply_supplementary_withdraw_purpose\\\":\\\"Purpose of Withdrawal\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_apply_supplementary_withdraw_purpose_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please enter the reason for your withdrawal (including but not limited to the relationship with the recipient of the assets, the purpose of the withdrawal funds, etc.).\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_apply_supplementary_register_purpose\\\":\\\"Purpose of Signing Up\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_apply_supplementary_register_purpose_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please enter the reason for signing up on MEXC.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_supplementary_form_profession_info\\\":\\\"Occupation Details\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_supplementary_form_profession_info_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please provide details of your current occupation.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_supplementary_upload_origin_id_hint\\\":\\\"Please provide a photo of the original document and ensure all information is visible and legible.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_bank_statement_hint\\\":\\\"Please submit the bank statement for the card used in fiat transactions from the past three months.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_bank_statement_hint_list1\\\":\\\"1. The statement must clearly show the cardholder’s name and card number.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_bank_statement_hint_list2\\\":\\\"2. Please confirm that the statement includes records of your recent MEXC fiat transactions.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_id_name\\\":\\\"ID Name\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_id_type_number\\\":\\\"ID Type and Number\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_id_number_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please enter the ID number\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_id_number\\\":\\\"Please enter the ID number that matches the document submitted this time.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_proof_of_address_hint\\\":\\\"Please provide proof of address issued within the past 6 months (such as a utility bill or a bank statement showing your address).\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_holding_id_photo_hint\\\":\\\"Please take a photo of you holding the ID with your face shown. Make sure the information on the ID is clear and visible.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_holding_id_and_bank_card_photo_hint\\\":\\\"To proceed, please provide a photo of yourself holding both your valid ID and the bank card used for fiat transactions.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_holding_id_and_bank_card_photo_hint_list1\\\":\\\"1. ID: Must clearly display the date of birth, nationality, and document validity period\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_holding_id_and_bank_card_photo_hint_list2\\\":\\\"2. Bank Card:\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_holding_id_and_bank_card_photo_hint_list3\\\":\\\"Provide a bank card used for recent fiat transactions. The last four digits of the card number must be clearly visible.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_holding_id_and_bank_card_photo_hint_list4\\\":\\\"If using a virtual card, please provide the bank's generated page, which must clearly display the virtual card number, the cardholder's name, expiration date, and other relevant details.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_holding_id_photo_video_hint\\\":\\\"Please record a video of you holding the ID with your face shown while verbally stating the following information: the current date, your name, and your MEXC account UID/email/mobile phone number. Make sure the video content and sound are clear.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_supplementary_upload_address_proof\\\":\\\"Proof of Address\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_bank_card_photo\\\":\\\"Bank Card Photo\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_bank_card_photo_hint\\\":\\\"Please provide a clear photo of the original bank card used for fiat transactions, ensuring that the card information is clearly visible.\\\",\\\"mc_bind_inviter_not_supported_error\\\":\\\"Your account does not support self-service referrer linking. Please contact Customer Service for assistance.\\\",\\\"mc_bind_inviter_not_exist\\\":\\\"This referrer does not exist. Please try again.\\\",\\\"mc_bind_inviter_yourself_error\\\":\\\"You cannot link yourse