 {count} chance(s) for every {amount} USDT in trading volume, up to {n} times.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_spot_trade_amount\\\":\\\"Total Spot Trading Volume\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_spot_trade_amount\\\":\\\"Reach a Spot trading volume of {amount} USDT to receive {count} chance(s).\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_spot_trade_amount_limit\\\":\\\"Earn {count} chance(s) for every {amount} USDT in Spot trading volume, up to {n} times.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_contract_trade_amount\\\":\\\"Total Futures Trading Volume\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_contract_trade_amount\\\":\\\"Reach a Futures trading volume of {amount} USDT to receive {count} chance(s).\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_contract_trade_amount_limit\\\":\\\"Earn {count} chance(s) for every {amount} USDT in Futures trading volume, up to {n} times.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_first_deposit_amount\\\":\\\"First Deposit + Total Deposit Volume\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_first_deposit_amount\\\":\\\"Make your first deposit and reach a total deposit amount of {amount} USDT to receive {count} chance(s).\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_first_deposit_amount_limit\\\":\\\"Make your first deposit to qualify. Earn {count} chance(s) for every {amount} USDT in deposits, up to {n} times.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_first_otc_deposit_amount\\\":\\\"First Deposit + Fiat Deposit Volume\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_first_otc_deposit_amount\\\":\\\"Make your first deposit and reach a total fiat deposit of {amount} USDT during the event to get {count} chance(s).\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_first_otc_deposit_amount_limit\\\":\\\"Make your first deposit to qualify. Earn {count} chance(s) for every {amount} USDT in fiat deposits during the event, up to {n} times.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_first_p2p_deposit_amount\\\":\\\"First Deposit + P2P Buy Volume\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_first_p2p_deposit_amount\\\":\\\"Make your first deposit and reach a P2P buy volume of {amount} USDT to get {count} chance(s).\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_first_p2p_deposit_amount_limit\\\":\\\"Make your first deposit to qualify. Earn {count} chance(s) for every {amount} USDT in P2P buy volume during the event, up to {n} times.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_first_chain_deposit_amount\\\":\\\"First Deposit + On-Chain Deposit Volume\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_first_chain_deposit_amount\\\":\\\"Make your first deposit and reach a total on-chain deposit of {amount} USDT to get {count} chance(s).\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_first_chain_deposit_amount_limit\\\":\\\"Make your first deposit to qualify. Earn {count} chance(s) for every {amount} USDT in on-chain deposits, up to {n} times.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_first_trade_amount\\\":\\\"First Trade + Total Trading Volume\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_first_trade_amount\\\":\\\"Complete your first trade and reach a total trading volume of {amount} USDT to get {count} chance(s).\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_first_trade_amount_limit\\\":\\\"Complete your first trade to qualify. Earn {count} chance(s) for every {amount} USDT in total trading volume, up to {n} times.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_first_spot_trade_amount\\\":\\\"First Trade + Spot Trading Volume\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_first_spot_trade_amount\\\":\\\"Complete your first trade and reach a Spot trading volume of {amount} USDT to get {count} chance(s).\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_first_spot_trade_amount_limit\\\":\\\"Complete your first trade to qualify. Earn {count} chance(s) for every {amount} USDT in Spot trading volume, up to {n} times.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_first_contract_trade_amount\\\":\\\"First Trade + Futures Trading Volume\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_first_contract_trade_amount\\\":\\\"Complete your first trade and reach a Futures trading volume of {amount} USDT to get {count} chance(s).\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_first_contract_trade_amount_limit\\\":\\\"Complete your first trade to qualify. Earn {count} chance(s) for every {amount} USDT in Futures trading volume, up to {n} times.\\\",\\\"mc_l