:\\\"Earn {count} chance(s) for every {referral} eligible users you invite, each with a deposit amount of {amount} USDT, up to {n} times.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_downline_otc_deposit_amount\\\":\\\"Invite Users and Complete Fiat Deposits\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_downline_otc_deposit_amount\\\":\\\"Invite {referral} eligible user and have them make a fiat deposit of {amount} USDT to get {count} chance(s).\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_downline_otc_deposit_amount_limit\\\":\\\"Earn {count} chance(s) for every {referral} eligible users you invite, each with a fiat deposit volume of {amount} USDT, up to {n} times.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_downline_p2p_deposit_amount\\\":\\\"Invite Users and Complete P2P Buy Orders\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_downline_p2p_deposit_amount\\\":\\\"Invite {referral} eligible user and have them make P2P buys of at least {amount} USDT to get {count} chance(s).\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_downline_p2p_deposit_amount_limit\\\":\\\"Earn {count} chance(s) for every {referral} eligible users you invite, each with a P2P buy volume of {amount} USDT, up to {n} times.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_invite_common_title\\\":\\\"Invite Users and Complete Tasks\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_invite_eftd\\\":\\\"Invite {referral} eligible user, and have them reach a total deposit of at least {usdt} USDT within {day} days of their first deposit to get {count} chance(s).\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_invite_eftd_limit\\\":\\\"For every {referral} eligible referees you invite, who accumulate at least {usdt} USDT in total deposits within {day} days of their first deposit, you'll receive {count} chance(s), up to {n} times.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_invite_efttc\\\":\\\"Invite {referral} eligible user and have them make at least {usdt} USDT in total deposits within {day} days of their first deposit and complete any Futures trade to get {count} chance(s).\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_info_invite_efttc_limit\\\":\\\"For every {referral} eligible referees you inv