ntrol mechanism, and no compensation will be provided.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_lottery_award_record\\\":\\\"Reward History\\\",\\\"mc_landings_lottery_no_record\\\":\\\"No data available\\\",\\\"mc_landings_lottery_task_completion_record\\\":\\\"Task Completion History\\\",\\\"mc_landings_spot_trading_volume\\\":\\\"Total Spot Trading Volume for Specified Pairs\\\",\\\"mc_landings_valid_trading_pairs_notice\\\":\\\"Only trading volumes for the following USDT Spot pairs count towards the valid trading volume:\\\",\\\"mc_landings_chain_deposit_amount\\\":\\\"On-Chain Deposit Volume for Specified Tokens\\\",\\\"mc_landings_valid_deposit_tokens_notice\\\":\\\"Only deposits of the following tokens count towards the valid deposit volume:\\\",\\\"mc_landings_register_now\\\":\\\"Register Now\\\",\\\"mc_landings_lottery_tasks\\\":\\\"Tasks\\\",\\\"mc_landings_lottery_tasks_info\\\":\\\"Due to the large number of participants, task data updates may be delayed by around 10 minutes.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_lottery_complete_tasks_reward\\\":\\\"Complete tasks to earn rewards\\\",\\\"mc_landings_task_completed\\\":\\\"Completed\\\",\\\"mc_landings_lottery_description\\\":\\\"Details\\\",\\\"mc_landings_lottery_conditions\\\":\\\"Terms and Conditions\\\",\\\"mc_landings_lottery_winning_modal_content\\\":\\\"Congratulations! You have won {prizeName} !\\\",\\\"mc_landings_activity_post_processing_default_message\\\":\\\"Event has ended\\\",\\\"mc_landings_activity_in_processing_default_message\\\":\\\"Join the event to claim your rewards\\\",\\\"mc_landings_back_button_text\\\":\\\"Back\\\",\\\"mc_landings_activity_pre_processing_default_message\\\":\\\"The event has not yet commenced, kindly check the official announcements for the event period.\\\",\\\"mc_landings_starting_count_down_title\\\":\\\"Event Starts in\\\",\\\"mc_landings_count_down_title\\\":\\\"Event Ends in\\\",\\\"mc_landings_count_down_remain_get_lottery_time_title\\\":\\\"Event Ends in\\\",\\\"mc_landings_count_down_over_title\\\":\\\"The event has ended\\\",\\\"mc_landings_events_starting_count_down_title\\\":\\\"Event starts in\\\",\\\"mc_landings_events_count_down_title\\\":\\\"Event ends in\\\",\\\"mc_landings_social_account_input_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter your {socialMedia} account\\\",\\\"mc_landings_join_input_wallet_address_label\\\":\\\"{walletName} Wallet Address\\\",\\\"mc_landings_wallet_account_input_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter your {walletName} Wallet Address\\\",\\\"mc_landings_join_input_nickname_label\\\":\\\"Nickname\\\",\\\"mc_landings_nickcname_input_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter your nickname\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_modal_type_email\\\":\\\"Email\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_modal_type_domain\\\":\\\"Domain\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_modal_type_channel\\\":\\\"Channel\\\",\\\"mc_official_head_title1\\\":\\\"Verify MEXC Official Channels, News and Publications\\\",\\\"mc_official_head_keywords1\\\":\\\"mexc verify, mexc news, mexc official account\\\",\\\"mc_official_head_description1\\\":\\\"Ensure the authenticity of MEXC communications. Use our official verification tool to confirm the legitimacy of channels, news, and publications related to MEXC.\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_title\\\":\\\"MEXC Verify\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_discription_new\\\":\\\"On this page, you can verify whether a URL, email address, phone number, or social media account like X and Telegram, is a verified MEXC official source. This will help you avoid losing your assets to phishing and online scams.\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_select_placeholder\\\":\\\"Select Channel\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_error_message\\\":\\\"By proceeding, you confirm that your selected channel and query content are correct\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_input_placeholder_new\\\":\\\"Please enter full query details\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_fotter_tip_3\\\":\\\"A must-know for all MEXC users: Fraud Prevention Manual. Beware of organized frauds and scams!\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_modal_tip_10\\\":\\\"*Do not disclose your account information and password to anyone.\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_modal_tip_11\\\":\\\"*Beware of scams and operate with caution. For more information, please refer to the \\u003ca\\u003eHelp Manual\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_verified_title\\\":\\\"Verified Official Source\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_unofficial\\\":\\\"Unverified Source\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_modal_tip_1\\\":\\\"Your search \\u003cb\\u003e[{query}]\\u003c/b\\u003e is an MEXC official {channel}\\\",\\\"mc_unofficial_verify_modal_tip_1\\\":\\\"Your search \\u003cb\\u003e[{query}]\\u003c/b\\u003e is not a verified MEXC official source\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_modal_error_tip_1\\\":\\\"Please ensure you have selected the correct channel for verification\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_modal_error_tip_2\\\":\\\"Please use the correct account format for verification\\\",\\\"mc_price_info_insight_subtitle5\\\":\\\"{fullName} ({shortName}) Distribution and Allocation\\\",\\\"mc_price_pred_about_des1\\\":\\\"Crypto price predictions involve forecasting or speculating on the future values of cryptocurrencies. These forecasts aim to predict the potential future worth of specific cryptocurrencies, such as Bitcoin or Ethereum. Various approaches are used to make these predictions, including technical analysis, fundamental analysis, sentiment analysis, expert opinions, and economic models. It's important to remember that crypto price predictions are inherently uncertain and subject to wide variations, owing to the cryptocurrency market's high volatility and unpredictability. Consider making your own price predictions or sharing your sentiments about {fullName} with MEXC Crypto Price Predictions!\\\",\\\"mc_price_pred_about_des5\\\":\\\"\\u003clabel\\u003eMarket Analysis:\\u003c/label\\u003e Predictions often involve analyzing market trends, news, and historical data. This comprehensive analysis aids investors in understanding the market dynamics and the factors influencing price changes.\\\",\\\"mc_price_pred_about_des7\\\":\\\"\\u003clabel\\u003eLong-term Planning:\\u003c/label\\u003e Investors looking for long-term gains rely on predictions to identify cryptocurrencies with potential for future growth.\\\",\\\"mc_price_pred_other_title\\\":\\\"Other Cryptos' Price Predictions\\\",\\\"mc_price_pred_chart_desc\\\":\\\"{fullName} ({shortName}) Price Prediction Chart\\\",\\\"mc_price_pred_sentiment_option1\\\":\\\"Very Bullish\\\",\\\"mc_price_pred_sentiment_option2\\\":\\\"Bullish\\\",\\\"mc_price_pred_detail_for_2050_content\\\":\\\"In 2050, the price of {fullName} could potentially see a growth of \\u003cltr\\u003e{percent}\\u003c/ltr\\u003e. It could reach a trading price of \\u003cltr\\u003e{price}\\u003c/ltr\\u003e.\\\",\\\"mc_price_prediction_detail_today_content\\\":\\\"The predicted price for {shortName} on \\u003cs\\u003e{today_date}\\u003c/s\\u003e is \\u003cs\\u003e{symbol}{today_price}\\u003c/s\\u003e. This estimate is based on the current forecast inputs and provides a quick snapshot of where prices could trade over the next 24 hours.\\u003ca\\u003eLearn more about {shortName} live price today.\\u003c/a\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_gee_test_error\\\":\\\"CAPTCHA verification failed\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_bind_senior_kyc_title\\\":\\\"Advanced KYC Verification\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_bind_senior_kyc_desc\\\":\\\"To ensure the security of your account, please complete Advanced KYC Verification. Verification results will be ready within 5-10 minutes. After verification, please return to this page to continue your application.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_bind_senior_kyc_btn_text\\\":\\\"Complete Advanced KYC Verification\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_face_title\\\":\\\"Facial Recognition\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_face_desc\\\":\\\"Please complete facial recognition and ensure it matches your Advanced KYC Verification information. Verification results will be ready within 5-10 minutes. Please refresh the page later to continue submitting your application.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_app_version_notice\\\":\\\"Please update the app to the latest version and try again\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_face_authenticating_h5_warning\\\":\\\"Verification will take 5–10 minutes. Please refresh the page to continue your application.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_face_btn_text\\\":\\\"Complete Facial Recognition\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_bind_palm_print_title\\\":\\\"Enable Palm Recognition\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_bind_palm_print_desc\\\":\\\"Enable palm recognition. Results will be returned within 5–10 minutes. Please refresh the page later to continue your application.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_bind_palm_print_btn_text\\\":\\\"Enable Palm Recognition\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_palm_print_title\\\":\\\"Palm Recognition\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_palm_print_desc\\\":\\\"Please complete palm recognition and ensure it matches the information you provided. Results will be returned within 5–10 minutes. Please refresh the page later to continue your application.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_palm_print_error\\\":\\\"Palm Recognition Failed\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_palm_print_btn_text\\\":\\\"Complete Palm Recognition\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_bind_three_choose_two_title\\\":\\\"Link Security Verification Methods\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_bind_three_choose_two_desc\\\":\\\"To ensure the security of your account, please link at least two security verification methods (SMS, Email, Google Authenticator). After linking, please return to this page to continue your application.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_bind_three_choose_two_btn_text\\\":\\\"Link Security Verification Method\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_three_choose_two_title\\\":\\\"Security Verification\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_three_choose_two_desc\\\":\\\"Please complete at least two security verifications (SMS, Email, Google Authenticator).\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_three_choose_two_btn_text\\\":\\\"Complete Security Verification\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_three_choose_two_error\\\":\\\"Incorrect verification code\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_bind_passkey_title\\\":\\\"Link Passkey\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_bind_passkey_desc\\\":\\\"To ensure the security of your account, please complete the passkey linking. After linking, please return to this page to continue your application.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_bind_passkey_btn_text\\\":\\\"Link Passkey\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_passkey_title\\\":\\\"Passkey Verification\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_passkey_desc\\\":\\\"Please complete the passkey verification\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_passkey_error\\\":\\\"Passkey verification failed\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_passkey_btn_text\\\":\\\"Complete Passkey Verification\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_gee_test_title\\\":\\\"CAPTCHA Verification\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_gee_test_desc\\\":\\\"Please complete the CAPTCHA verification\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_gee_test_btn_text\\\":\\\"Verify\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_tips_content_only_palm_print\\\":\\\"Complete palm recognition so the system can review it in real time and update your account features\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_tips_content_only_face\\\":\\\"Complete facial recognition so the system can review it in real time and update your account features\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_tips_content_only_other\\\":\\\"Complete at least two multi-factor security verifications so the system can review them in real time and update your account features\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_tips_content_palm_print_and_other\\\":\\\"Complete palm recognition or at least two multi-factor security verifications so the system can review them in real time and update your account features\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_tips_content\\\":\\\"Complete facial recognition or at least two multi-factor security verifications so the system can review them in real time and update your account features\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_title\\\":\\\"Account Security Verification\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_success_desc\\\":\\\"Your account security verification has been completed. Please visit the Futures trading page to view the restored features.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_no_need_verify_title\\\":\\\"No Verification Required\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_no_need_verify_desc\\\":\\\"No account security verification is required at this time. For assistance, please contact our online Customer Service.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_other_verifies_title\\\":\\\"Multi-Factor Security Verification\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_back_to_support\\\":\\\"Back\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_completed\\\":\\\"Completed\\\",\\\"mc_support_help_center\\\":\\\"Help Center\\\",\\\"mc_support_help_center_meta_title\\\":\\\"Help Center: MEXC Customer Service, Guides, and FAQs | MEXC Help Center\\\",\\\"mc_support_help_center_meta_description\\\":\\\"Explore MEXC's comprehensive Customer Service and self-help guides, review important FAQs related to MEXC, and contact the MEXC Help Center's 24/7 Customer Service team\\\",\\\"mc_support_see_more_articles\\\":\\\"View all {nums} articles\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_option_account_related\\\":\\\"Account Features (Sign-up / Login / Cancelation / 2FA / KYC)\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_option_deposit\\\":\\\"Deposit \\u0026 Withdrawal Related\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_option_spot_margin_etf\\\":\\\"Spot Trading\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_option_futures\\\":\\\"Futures Trading\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_option_affiliate_rebases\\\":\\\"Affiliate Related\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_option_platform_events\\\":\\\"Platform Events\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_option_risk_control\\