nsfer\\\":\\\"Global bank transfers\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_credit_card_buy\\\":\\\"Buying crypto with a credit card\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_third_party_buy\\\":\\\"Buying crypto from a third party\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_MEXC_card\\\":\\\"MEXC Card\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_OCT_security\\\":\\\"OTC trading security issues\\\",\\\"mc_support_not_found_page_title\\\":\\\"The page you are looking for does not exist\\\",\\\"mc_support_not_found_title\\\":\\\"Ah!\\\",\\\"mc_support_not_found_subtitle\\\":\\\"The page you are looking for does not exist\\\",\\\"mc_support_not_found_description\\\":\\\"You may have entered the wrong URL, or the page has been moved\\\",\\\"mc_support_not_found_go_back\\\":\\\"Take me back to the home page\\\",\\\"mc_support_common_search_placeholder\\\":\\\"Search\\\",\\\"mc_support_system_busy_page_title\\\":\\\"No Result Found\\\",\\\"mc_support_system_busy_subtitle\\\":\\\"The search system is currently busy\\\",\\\"mc_support_system_busy_description\\\":\\\"Please try again later\\\",\\\"mc_support_system_busy_go_back\\\":\\\"Back to Home\\\",\\\"mc_support_beginner_guide_meta_title\\\":\\\"Help Center Guideline: KYC, App Download \\u0026 Account Management | MEXC Help Center\\\",\\\"mc_support_beginner_guide_meta_description\\\":\\\"Find clear answers to beginner questions on MEXC. This guide covers KYC, app download, and account management, with easy tutorials and FAQs to help you start trading safely.\\\",\\\"mc_support_account_and_security_setting_meta_title\\\":\\\"MEXC Account \\u0026 Security Settings: Google Authenticator \\u0026 2FA Guide | MEXC Help Center\\\",\\\"mc_support_account_and_security_setting_meta_description\\\":\\\"Learn how to secure your crypto account at the MEXC Help Center. Fix login and Google Authenticator issues, link your phone number and email, and review FAQs to improve account security.\\\",\\\"mc_support_fraud_prevention_meta_title\\\":\\\"Fraud Prevention: Common Crypto Risks, Scam Detection \\u0026 Safety Tips | MEXC Help Center\\\",\\\"mc_support_fraud_prevention_meta_description\\\":\\\"Get help protecting your funds on MEXC. Learn about common crypto and P2P scams, read fraud-prevention FAQs, and find tips to avoid phishing, SMS, and impersonation attacks.\\\",\\\"mc_support_deposit_withdrawal_guide_meta_title\\\":\\\"Deposit \\u0026 Withdrawal Guide: Crypto Transfers, Issues \\u0026 Proof of Reserves | MEXC Help Center\\\",\\\"mc_support_deposit_withdrawal_guide_meta_description\\\":\\\"Explore answers about deposits and withdrawals on MEXC. Use this guide for step-by-step help with funding your account, fixing incorrect transfers, and understanding Proof of Reserves.\\\",\\\"mc_support_affiliate_zone_meta_title\\\":\\\"Affiliate Zone: Referral Program, Commissions \\u0026 Fee Rates | MEXC Help Center\\\",\\\"mc_support_affiliate_zone_meta_description\\\":\\\"Get a complete guide to the MEXC Affiliate Program. Learn how to join, manage your referral dashboard, track commissions, and understand fee rates in the Affiliate Zone.\\\",\\\"mc_support_fiat_p2p_meta_title\\\":\\\"Fiat \\u0026 P2P Trading Guide: Payment Methods \\u0026 Merchant Rules | MEXC Help Center\\\",\\\"mc_support_fiat_p2p_meta_description\\\":\\\"Find support for MEXC Fiat and P2P trading. Get answers about posting ads, managing merchants, payment methods, and limits through FAQs.\\\",\\\"mc_support_secondary_category_title\\\":\\\"{secondaryCategory} Help: Guides, FAQs \\u0026 Support | MEXC Help Center\\\",\\\"mc_support_secondary_category_description\\\":\\\"Find answers about {secondaryCategory} in the MEXC Help Center. Get guides, FAQs, and help related to {secondaryCategory} under the {parentCategory} section.\\\",\\\"mc_support_breadcrumbs_root\\\":\\\"Help Center\\\",\\\"mc_customer_hotline_title\\\":\\\"Customer Hotline\\\",\\\"mc_customer_hotline_welcome_1\\\":\\\"Hello!\\\",\\\"mc_customer_hotline_welcome_2\\\":\\\"This is the MEXC customer hotline.\\\",\\\"mc_customer_hotline_welcome_3\\\":\\\"How can I help you?\\\",\\\"mc_customer_hotline_phone_number\\\":\\\"Phone Number\\\",\\\"mc_customer_hotline_working_hours\\\":\\\"Working Hours\\\",\\\"mc_customer_hotline_action\\\":\\\"Contact Us\\\",\\\"mc_support_article_sidebar_heading\\\":\\\"Articles in this category\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_enter\\\":\\\"Please enter\\\",\\\"mc_support_online_chat_loading_info\\\":\\\"If the Customer Service page fails to load, please go to the MEXC App settings and clear cache, then try connecting to Customer Service again. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/br\\u003eYou can also contact us by email at \\u003cspan class=“email”\\u003eservice@support.mexc.com\\u003c/span\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_support_online_chat_top_bar\\\":\\\"Customer Service\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_complaint_title\\\":\\\"Complaint Title\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_error_required\\\":\\\"This field cannot be empty.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_error_length\\\":\\\"Exceeded length limit by {length} characters\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_detailed_description\\\":\\\"Detailed Description\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_describe_complaint\\\":\\\"Please describe the matter of your complaint\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_error_email\\\":\\\"Please enter the correct email address.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_label_attachments\\\":\\\"Attachments\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_extra_attachments\\\":\\\"Supports pdf, csv, docx, doc, xlsx, xls, pptx, zip, png, jpg, gif, mp4, txt, etc. The maximum size of a single file is 50MB.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_label_type_general\\\":\\\"Issue Category\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_label_title\\\":\\\"Inquiry Title\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_placeholder_title\\\":\\\"Enter your inquiry\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_placeholder_description_general\\\":\\\"Enter your request and detailed information. Our team will provide you a response via email within 24 hours.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_currency_grid\\\":\\\"Crypto-Network\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_number\\\":\\\"Quantity\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_address\\\":\\\"MEXC Address of the Fund Inflow\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_report_options1\\\":\\\"Stolen funds flowing into MEXC\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_report_options2\\\":\\\"Fraudulent funds flowing into MEXC\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_report_options3\\\":\\\"Other problematic funds flowing into MEXC\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_reporter_options1\\\":\\\"Personal\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_reporter_options2\\\":\\\"Organization (Project Party / Trading Platform / Others)\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_report_type\\\":\\\"Report Type\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_reporter\\\":\\\"Identity of Reporting Person\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_organization_name\\\":\\\"Name of Organization\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_web\\\":\\\"Official Website\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_web_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please enter the official website of your organization or relevant links\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_email_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please enter your email address. We will respond to you via email.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_report_title\\\":\\\"Report Title\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_report_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please provide a brief description of the subject of your current report\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_event_desc\\\":\\\"Incident Description\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_event_desc_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please describe the process of the abnormal funds flowing into MEXC, including but not limited to: \\\\n1. Information and evidence regarding the source platform/account/address, crypto, and quantity of the fund. \\\\n2. Reason for the fund transfer. \\\\n3. The time, channel and method in which the abnormal funds flowed into the MEXC platform, including the addresses/accounts involved.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_fund_flow_info\\\":\\\"Fund Inflow Information\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_direct_upload\\\":\\\"Enter Text\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_file_upload\\\":\\\"Upload Attachments\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_direct_upload_placeholder1\\\":\\\"Please fill in the details according to the following format. For a large number of entries, you can select [Upload Attachments], fill in the details of the reported funds using the form, and upload it.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_direct_upload_extra\\\":\\\"Please download the template, fill in the relevant details of the funds flowing into MEXC according to the format, and upload it here. \\u003ca\\u003eClick to download the template\\u003c/a\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_coin_withdrawal_screenshot\\\":\\\"Withdrawal Screenshot\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_label_other_report_extra\\\":\\\"If you have any other supporting documents, please upload them together.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_extra_attachments3\\\":\\\"Supports pdf, csv, docx, doc, xlsx, xls, pptx, zip, png, jpg, gif, mp4, txt, etc. The maximum size of a single file is 50MB. Supports a maximum of 10 attachments.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_success_title\\\":\\\"Submitted successfully\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_success_body\\\":\\\"Your form has been received. We will provide you a response as soon as possible.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_continue_button\\\":\\\"Continue to Submit\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_to_home_button\\\":\\\"Go to Homepage\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_label_country\\\":\\\"Country\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_organization_name\\\":\\\"Name of Judicial Organization\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_organization_name_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please enter the name of the organization\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_organization_id_proof\\\":\\\"Judicial Identification\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_organization_id_proof_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please provide the work credentials or relevant identification proof of the judicial organization / law enforcement personnel\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_label_official_email\\\":\\\"Official Email Address\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_label_official_email_hint\\\":\\\"Please enter the official email address of the judicial organization. We will respond to you via email.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_label_official_phone\\\":\\\"Official Contact Number\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_label_official_phone_hint\\\":\\\"Please enter the official phone number of the judicial organization. We will contact you when necessary.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_label_title_law_hint\\\":\\\"Please provide a brief description of your current judicial subject\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_need_to_freeze_label\\\":\\\"Does this require MEXC to freeze one or several platform accounts?\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_need_to_freeze_modal_title\\\":\\\"MEXC Reminder:\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_need_to_freeze_modal_content\\\":\\\"If you wish to freeze one or multiple MEXC accounts, please prepare and upload the relevant judicial documents. Otherwise, MEXC may be unable to cooperate with you in freezing these accounts in a timely manner. Please also note that MEXC provides judicial assistance, including account-freezing assistance, on a voluntary basis, in order to better combat criminal activities. If MEXC determines that your documents do not meet requirements, or if there are other circumstances in which MEXC deems it inappropriate to cooperate, we reserve the right to refuse your request.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_need_to_freeze_yes\\\":\\\"Yes, I wish to freeze one or multiple accounts\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_need_to_freeze_no\\\":\\\"No, I do not wish to freeze any accounts\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_remark\\\":\\\"Judicial Request Matters\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_remark_hint\\\":\\\"Please provide specific details regarding your judicial/law enforcement request and the matters requiring MEXC's cooperation\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_document\\\":\\\"Judicial Documents\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_document_hint\\\":\\\"Please provide valid judicial/law enforcement investigation documents\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_judicial_document_number\\\":\\\"Legal Document Number\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_label_is_need_investigation\\\":\\\"Is Information Receipt Needed?\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_option_yes\\\":\\\"Yes\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_option_no\\\":\\\"No\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_investigation_info\\\":\\\"Judicial Investigation Information\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_file_support\\\":\\\"Only files in .xlsx or .xls format are accepted.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_investigation_info_extra\\\":\\\"\\u003cspan\\u003eIf you require MEXC's assistance for a judicial investigation, \\u003ca\\u003eplease click here to download the attachment template\\u003c/a\\u003e and fill in the judicial investigation information in the specified format.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_extra_attachments2\\\":\\\"Supports a maximum of 10 attachments.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_check_title1\\\":\\\"I am an authorized law enforcement officer or government personnel conducting an investigation, and this is an official request.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_check_title2\\\":\\\"I have read and understand \\u003cButton\\u003e[Law Enforcement Guidelines]\\u003c/Button\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_error_unchecked\\\":\\\"Please check the relevant contents first\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_error_file_length_over_10\\\":\\\"Only a maximum of 10 attachments can be uploaded. Please select again.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_type_general_title\\\":\\\"If you come across any problems while using MEXC, you can submit a ticket here. We will promptly respond to you via email.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_otc_description\\\":\\\"If you come across any problems while using MEXC OTC trading, please feel free to submit this ticket. To expedite the resolution of your issue, kindly include the following relevant details, and we will respond to you via email at the earliest opportunity.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/br\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/br\\u003e[P2P Issues] 1. Transaction Order Number 2. Proof of Transfer/Non-Receipt of Funds\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/br\\u003e[Global Bank Transfers] 1. Transaction Order Number 2. Payment Amount/Bank Account (IBAN) 3. Screenshots of the Issue\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/br\\u003e[Financial/Credit Card Issues] 1. Transaction Order Number 2. Screenshots of the Issue 3. Last Four Digits of the Payment Card\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/br\\u003e[Third-Party Transactions] 1. Transaction Order Number 2. Screenshots of the Issue\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/br\\u003e[MEXC Card] 1. Screenshots of the Issue\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_financial_title\\\":\\\"If your stolen/defrauded funds have flowed into the MEXC platform, you can submit this report ticket to provide a detailed description of the incident and the details of the funds. We will review and respond to you as soon as possible.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_complaint_description\\\":\\\"If you are dissatisfied with MEXC's products/services or wish to file a complaint against any MEXC official, you can submit a ticket here. We will promptly verify and address your concerns. Thank you for your interest and support. We will keep on improving to provide you with better services.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_hint1\\\":\\\"\\u003cp\\u003eWelcome to MEXC Law Enforcement Online Request System (\\\\\\\"LEORS\\\\\\\"). Please follow the instructions given under \\u003cButton\\u003e[Law Enforcement Guidelines]\\u003c/Button\\u003e. \\u003cspan\\u003eFailure to do so may result in your request left unattended.\\u003c/span\\u003e \\u003c/p\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_hint2\\\":\\\"MEXC accepts law enforcement request(s) made by officials of judiciary or government agencies with competent jurisdiction and authorities ONLY.  \\u003cspan\\u003e If you are not aforementioned officials, your request(s) will not be processed.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_law_hint3\\\":\\\"Note: all materials must be submitted in English or accompanied by certified English translation. Please fill out this ticket in English.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_submit_button_text\\\":\\\"Submit\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_type_general\\\":\\\"Submit Inquiry\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_label_type_financial\\\":\\\"Report Abnormal Funds\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_type_law\\\":\\\"Law Enforcement Requests\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_option_otc\\\":\\\"OTC Consultation\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_complaint_intention\\\":\\\"File a Complaint\\\",\\\"mc_support_index_page_title\\\":\\\"Help Center\\\",\\\"mc_support_search_results_new\\\":\\\"Search Results\\\",\\\"mc_support_help_center_subtitle\\\":\\\"7x24 Customer Service Support\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_error_contain_url\\\":\\\"Please add URL in the description instead of entering it here\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_error_duplicate_submission\\\":\\\"Hi, we have received your feedback. If you have any other questions, kindly submit them after 3 minutes.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_error_file_type\\\":\\\"Please upload the file in the correct format\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_api_error\\\":\\\"API error\\\",\\\"mc_support_request_api_error\\\":\\\"An abnormal error occurred. Please re-upload the file.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_upload_button_text\\\":\\\"Upload or paste your files here\\\",\\\"mc_support_help_center_enter_question\\\":\\\"Ask us anything\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_error_file_amount\\\":\\\"Upload up to {count} files, please do not continue uploading\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_error_file_size\\\":\\\"The file is too large to be uploaded. Please keep the file size under 50MB.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_format_error\\\":\\\"Incorrect format. Please upload the file in a format that meets the requirements.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_upload_file_name_error\\\":\\\"Please do not include the \\\\\\\"@\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\",\\\\\\\" or \\\\\\\"#\\\\\\\" symbols in the file name. Please change it and try again.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_important_notice\\\":\\\"Important Reminder\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_mandatory_template_download\\\":\\\"Please ensure you click to \\u003cButton\\u003edownload the attached template\\u003c/Button\\u003e and fill in the judicial investigation information as required. Otherwise, your request will not be processed promptly.\\\",\\\"mc_support_article_category_list\\\":\\\"Category List\\\",\\\"mc_support_online_chat\\\":\\\"Online Customer Service\\\",\\\"mc_support_online_chat_desc\\\":\\\"Chat online with MEXC Customer Service. Our representatives are available 24/7.\\\",\\\"mc_support_help_center_self_services\\\":\\\"Self-Services\\\",\\\"mc_support_help_center_faq\\\":\\\"FAQ\\\",\\\"mc_support_help_center_announcements\\\":\\\"Announcements\\\",\\\"mc_support_more_helps\\\":\\\"More Support\\\",\\\"mc_support_load_more\\\":\\\"See More\\\",\\\"mc_support_help_center_check\\\":\\\"View More\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_board_title\\\":\\\"MEXC Community Voice\\\",\\\"mc_support_top\\\":\\\"Pin\\\",\\\"mc_support_link_learn_button\\\":\\\"Learn\\\",\\\"mc_support_see_all\\\":\\\"View All\\\",\\\"mc_support_search_no_results\\\":\\\"{count} results found for \\u003cspan\\u003e\\\\\\\"{keyword}\\\\\\\"\\u003c/span\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_empty_state\\\":\\\"To Be Announced\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_advantage_question\\\":\\\"What stands out to you about MEXC?\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_improve_question\\\":\\\"How can we better serve you?\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_change_question\\\":\\\"What improvements would you like to see?\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_rating_question\\\":\\\"How likely are you to recommend MEXC to a friend? (0 = Not likely, 10 = Very likely)\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_not_likely\\\":\\\"Not Likely\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_very_likely\\\":\\\"Very Likely\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_share_thoughts\\\":\\\"Share your thoughts...\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_submit_rating\\\":\\\"Submit\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_platform_app\\\":\\\"App\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_platform_desktop\\\":\\\"Desktop\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_platform_web\\\":\\\"Web\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_desc_label\\\":\\\"Share your improvement suggestions\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_won_usdt\\\":\\\"Won {usdt} USDT\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_attachment\\\":\\\"Attachment\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_platform\\\":\\\"Platform\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_submission_time\\\":\\\"Submission Time\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_review_remark\\\":\\\"Reviewer's Note\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_my_submissions\\\":\\\"My Submissions\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_no_submissions\\\":\\\"No submissions yet\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_board_subtitle\\\":\\\"User-first by design. Your voice drives what's next at MEXC.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_user_id\\\":\\\"User ID\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_award_reason\\\":\\\"Award Reason\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_quarter_num\\\":\\\"Q{num}\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_award_tab_everyone\\\":\\\"Participation Rewards\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_award_tab_quarterly\\\":\\\"Star of the Quarter\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_award_tab_yearly\\\":\\\"Star of the Year\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_award\\\":\\\"Awarded {num}\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_rank_champion\\\":\\\"Champion\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_rank_runner_up\\\":\\\"Runner-up\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_rank_third_place\\\":\\\"Third Place\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_reward_title\\\":\\\"Your Ideas, Rewarded\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_reward_desc\\\":\\\"Great ideas are valuable in their own right. Contributors of adopted ideas can earn up to \\u003cspan\\u003e{usdt} USDT\\u003c/span\\u003e.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_reward_contributor\\\":\\\"Contributor Reward\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_up_to\\\":\\\"Up to\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_reward_quarterly\\\":\\\"Quarterly Insight Award\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_champion\\\":\\\"Champion\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_runner_up\\\":\\\"Runner-up\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_third_place\\\":\\\"Third Place\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_reward_yearly\\\":\\\"Voice of the Year\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_contact_cs_app\\\":\\\"For account or operational issues, tap the top-right corner to contact Customer Service\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_contact_cs\\\":\\\"For account or operational issues, contact \\u003ca\\u003eCustomer Service\\u003c/a\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_slogan\\\":\\\"Turn Ideas into Impact\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_success_message\\\":\\\"Thank you for sharing this with us. Your feedback matters and helps shape what's next.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_submit_another\\\":\\\"Submit Another\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_back_home\\\":\\\"Back to Home\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_desc_placeholder\\\":\\\"Tell us more: \\\\n[Scenario] In what situation did you encounter the issue? \\\\n[Issue] What didn't work as expected?\\\\n[Expected outcome] What would you like to see instead?\\\\n[Suggestion] How can we improve it?\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_platform_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please select the platform(s) (multiple selections allowed)\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_attachment_upload\\\":\\\"Upload Attachment (Optional)\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_extra_attachments_new\\\":\\\"Supports pdf, docx, xlsx, xls, mov, png, jpg, jpeg, gif, mp4, txt, avi. The maximum size of a single file is 50MB.\\\",\\\"mc_support_requests_suggestion_submit\\\":\\\"Submit\\\",\\\"mx_survey_not_logged_in_message\\\":\\\"You are currently not logged in. Please log in to participate.\\\",\\\"mx_survey_ended\\\":\\\"Questionnaire Has Ended\\\",\\\"mx_survey_submission_limit_reached\\\":\\\"You have reached the maximum submission limit and cannot continue to participate\\\",\\\"mx_survey_not_submitted\\\":\\\"You are temporarily unable to participate in this questionnaire\\\",\\\"mx_survey_return\\\":\\\"Back\\\",\\\"mx_survey_mandatory\\\":\\\"Required\\\",\\\"mx_survey_file_upload_error\\\":\\\"Unexpected error. Please re-upload\\\",\\\"mx_survey_file_count_limit_warning\\\":\\\"You can upload up to {number} attachments. Please reselect.\\\",\\\"mx_survey_file_format_size_hint\\\":\\\"Only {type} formats are supported, up to {size} MB\\\",\\\"mx_survey_file_format_error\\\":\\\"Please upload a file in the correct format\\\",\\\"mx_survey_upload_hint\\\":\\\"Upload or paste here\\\",\\\"mx_survey_min_selection_only\\\":\\\"Minimum selection: {min}\\\",\\\"mx_survey_max_selection_only\\\":\\\"Maximum selection: {max}. Please deselect other options before choosing.\\\",\\\"mx_survey_selection_min_info\\\":\\\"Minimum selection: {min}\\\",\\\"mx_survey_selection_max_info\\\":\\\"Maximum selection: {max}, Selected: {selected}\\\",\\\"mx_survey_selection_info\\\":\\\"Minimum selection: {min}, Maximum selection: {max}, Selected: {selected}\\\",\\\"mx_survey_submission_success\\\":\\\"Submitted Successfully\\\",\\\"mx_survey_completion_thank_you\\\":\\\"You have completed the submission. Thank you for your participation.\\\",\\\"mx_survey_preview_page_notice\\\":\\\"This is the questionnaire preview page. You cannot submit the questionnaire here.\\\",\\\"mx_survey_submit\\\":\\\"Submit\\\",\\\"mx_survey_system_too_many_requests\\\":\\\"Too frequent requests, please try again later\\\",\\\"mx_survey_system_error\\\":\\\"System error. Please try again later.\\\",\\\"mx_survey_system_param_error\\\":\\\"The interface parameters are incorrect. Please resubmit the parameters.\\\",\\\"mx_survey_content_change_refresh\\\":\\\"There have been changes to the questionnaire content. Please refresh the page and resubmit.\\\",\\\"mx_survey_question_mandatory\\\":\\\"All questions in the questionnaire are mandatory.\\\",\\\"mx_survey_option_blank_mandatory\\\":\\\"All questions with fill-in-the-blank options are mandatory.\\\",\\\"mx_survey_min_options_select\\\":\\\"For multiple-choice questions, please select at least {min} options.\\\",\\\"mx_survey_max_options_select\\\":\\\"For multiple-choice questions, please select at most {max} options.\\\",\\\"mx_survey_valid_score_input\\\":\\\"Please enter a reasonable rating value.\\\",\\\"mx_survey_desktop_version\\\":\\\"Web Version\\\",\\\"mx_survey_mobile_version\\\":\\\"Mobile Version\\\",\\\"mx_survey_file_uploading_warning\\\":\\\"Files still uploading. Please wait until the upload is complete before submitting.\\\",\\\"mx_survey_account_not_logged_in\\\":\\\"Account Not Logged In\\\",\\\"mx_survey_not_participating\\\":\\\"Participate Later\\\",\\\"mx_survey_go_to_login\\\":\\\"Log In Now\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_center\\\":\\\"Ticket Center\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_my_tickets\\\":\\\"My Tickets\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_submit\\\":\\\"Submit Form\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_center_description\\\":\\\"If you encounter any issues while using MEXC, submit a ticket and we'll get back to you as soon as possible.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_ticket_no\\\":\\\"Ticket No.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_title\\\":\\\"Ticket Title\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_created_at\\\":\\\"Created On\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_last_reply_time\\\":\\\"Last Reply Time\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status\\\":\\\"Ticket Status\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_operation\\\":\\\"Actions\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_view\\\":\\\"View\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_reply\\\":\\\"Reply\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_search_placeholder\\\":\\\"Search by ticket no. or title\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_no_tickets\\\":\\\"No tickets\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_wait_for_upload\\\":\\\"Please wait for the upload to complete before submitting\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_submit_success\\\":\\\"Submitted successfully\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_submit_button\\\":\\\"Submit\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_please_select\\\":\\\"Please select\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_please_upload_file\\\":\\\"Please upload a file\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_please_input\\\":\\\"Please enter\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_input_phone_format\\\":\\\"Only numbers, letters, and \\\\\\\"+\\\\\\\" are allowed (3–16 characters)\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_input_email_error\\\":\\\"Please enter a valid email address\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_input_number_only\\\":\\\"Numbers only\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_no_data\\\":\\\"No data available\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_pending\\\":\\\"Not Processed\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_processing\\\":\\\"In Progress\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_waiting_customer\\\":\\\"Awaiting User Response\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_customer_replied\\\":\\\"User Responded\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_resolved\\\":\\\"Resolved\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_closed\\\":\\\"Closed\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_pending_tooltip\\\":\\\"We've received your ticket and are arranging for it to be assigned.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_processing_tooltip\\\":\\\"Your ticket is now being handled. We're actively looking into your issue.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_waiting_customer_tooltip\\\":\\\"We've sent you a message requesting additional information. Please check and reply as soon as possible.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_customer_replied_tooltip\\\":\\\"We've received your reply and are continuing to work on your request.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_resolved_tooltip\\\":\\\"Your issue has been resolved.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_closed_tooltip\\\":\\\"This ticket has been closed. If you need further assistance, please submit a new ticket.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_upload_success\\\":\\\"Upload successful\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_upload_failed\\\":\\\"Upload failed\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_error_file_amount\\\":\\\"You can upload up to {count} files.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_error_file_size\\\":\\\"File size must not exceed {size} MB.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_upload\\\":\\\"Upload\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_upload_tips\\\":\\\"You can upload up to {count} files. Each file must not exceed {size} MB.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_reached_top\\\":\\\"You've reached the end\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_closed_hint\\\":\\\"This ticket is closed and no longer accepts replies. If you need further assistance, please submit a new ticket.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_reply_success\\\":\\\"Reply Sent\\\",\\\"mc_file_upload_error\\\":\\\"Upload error. Please try again.\\\",\\\"mc_id_auth_surname_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please enter your last name\\\",\\\"mc_id_auth_surname\\\":\\\"Last Name\\\",\\\"mc_id_auth_firstname_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please enter your first name\\\",\\\"mc_id_auth_firstname\\\":\\\"First Name\\\",\\\"mc_please_select\\\":\\\"Please select\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_failed_risk_removal_tag\\\":\\\"Your account has been flagged for unusual activity. Please submit documents for further review.\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_failed_challenge_status\\\":\\\"Your account requires a security review. Please complete the verification to continue.\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_failed_contract_pending_order\\\":\\\"You have open Futures orders\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_please_submit_risk_control_guide\\\":\\\"MEXC Risk Control Guidelines\\\",\\\"mc_common_status\\\":\\\"Status\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_contract_forecast_contract_trading\\\":\\\"Event Futures Trades\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_spot_flash_transaction\\\":\\\"Convert History\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_capital_transfer\\\":\\\"Send History\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_capital_asset_snapshot\\\":\\\"Asset Snapshots\\\",\\\"mc_official_verify_go_report_fraud_btn\\\":\\\"Report Fraud\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_fraud_type_funds\\\":\\\"Report Fund Fraud\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_fraud_type_fake_account_url\\\":\\\"Report Account/Website Impersonation\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_title\\\":\\\"Statement on Fraud Reporting\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc1\\\":\\\"If you have experienced fraud or fraudulent activity while using the MEXC platform (including cryptocurrency transfers made as a result of deception, misrepresentation, or other unlawful conduct), we treat such matters with the utmost seriousness. We strongly advise that you take the following actions without delay:\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc1_list_title1\\\":\\\"1. Report to Law Enforcement Authorities\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc1_list_content1\\\":\\\"Cryptocurrency-related fraud cases require investigation by competent local law enforcement authorities. Please report the incident to your local police as soon as possible to protect your legal rights and interests.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc1_list_title2\\\":\\\"2. Secure Your Account\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc1_list_content2\\\":\\\"If you suspect that your MEXC account has been compromised in connection with the scam, please take immediate steps to secure your account (such as changing your password, enabling two-factor authentication, or temporarily freezing your account).\\\\nIf you need assistance, please contact MEXC Online Customer Service promptly.\\\\n\\\\n\\u003cbutton\\u003eHow to Change Your Password, Enable Two-Factor Authentication, or Temporarily Freeze Your Account\\u003c/button\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc2_content1\\\":\\\"Important Terms \\u0026 Conditions\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc2_content2\\\":\\\"Before completing the reporting form below, please read the following terms carefully and ensure your agreement before submitting:\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc3_list_title\\\":\\\"Key Terms\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc3_list_content1\\\":\\\"(1) MEXC is not a law enforcement agency. Submitting a report to MEXC does not constitute filing a report with any law enforcement authority, and MEXC is under no obligation to contact law enforcement on your behalf. MEXC cannot guarantee any specific outcome from your report. While we will review the information you provide, we assume no liability for the submitted information and are not responsible for any actions (or inactions) taken in response to the report.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc3_list_content2\\\":\\\"(2) MEXC is not responsible for content, services, or actions originating from third parties or platforms outside MEXC.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc3_list_content3\\\":\\\"(3) Our ability to act is limited by local laws, regulations, and the rights of other users. As such, we may not be able to take subsequent actions exactly as you expect, and we cannot guarantee the effectiveness of any measures or actions taken.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc3_list_content4\\\":\\\"(4) We will make reasonable efforts to keep you informed about the progress of your report; however, we cannot guarantee real-time or comprehensive updates. In certain cases, legal or compliance requirements may prevent us from disclosing details of ongoing investigations.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc3_list_content5\\\":\\\"(5) By submitting information, you agree that we may process your personal data for investigation purposes and may share it with law enforcement authorities if legally required. All data processing will be conducted in accordance with our \\u003cbutton\\u003ePrivacy Policy\\u003c/button\\u003e.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc3_list_content6\\\":\\\"(6) By submitting a report through this channel, you agree to allow MEXC to assist in handling the report and waive any claims against MEXC related to the report.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc4_content1\\\":\\\"Confirm and Submit\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_desc4_content2\\\":\\\"By clicking the button below, you acknowledge that you have read and agree to all of the above terms, which will be incorporated into your report. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not click the button.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_declare_confirm_btn\\\":\\\"Agree and Continue\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_header\\\":\\\"Report Fraud\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_submitted_content_title\\\":\\\"Report Submitted\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_submitted_content1\\\":\\\"\\u003cb\\u003ePlease note that the information you submitted will be used solely for internal records and documentation. We will not proactively contact you regarding feedback or follow-up on this matter.\\u003c/b\\u003eBe cautious of any individual or organization claiming they can help recover lost funds, especially if they request upfront fees. Such offers carry a very high risk of secondary scams.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_submitted_content2\\\":\\\"Please note that blockchain transactions are inherently immutable and anonymous. This characteristic makes tracing funds and recovering assets extremely challenging. MEXC does not have the ability to trace on-chain funds, and even with our best efforts, the lost funds may not be recoverable.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_submitted_content3\\\":\\\"After submitting your report, we recommend that you retain all relevant evidence, including transaction records and communication logs. We also strongly advise that you report the incident immediately to your local law enforcement authorities, who can work with specialized blockchain investigation teams to conduct further inquiries.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_submitted_content4\\\":\\\"If you require any additional assistance, please do not hesitate to contact us.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_submitted_btn\\\":\\\"I Understand\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_report_type_label\\\":\\\"Report Type\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_report_type_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please select the scenario\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_fraud_address_label\\\":\\\"Scam Address\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_fraud_address_placeholder\\\":\\\"Recipient address provided by the scammer\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_transfer_amount_label\\\":\\\"Transfer Amount\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_transfer_amount_placeholder\\\":\\\"The amount you transferred\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_transfer_currency_label\\\":\\\"Transfer Crypto\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_transfer_currency_placeholder\\\":\\\"The crypto you used for the transfer\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_transfer_network_label\\\":\\\"Transfer Network\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_transfer_network_placeholder\\\":\\\"The network you used for the transfer\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_fraud_channel_label\\\":\\\"Scam Channel\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_fraud_channel_placeholder\\\":\\\"Platforms or software used by the scammer to commit fraud or transfer funds (e.g., Telegram, X)\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_fraud_contact_label\\\":\\\"Scammer's Contact Information\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_fraud_contact_placeholder\\\":\\\"Email address, mobile number, social media ID, etc.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_fake_account_url_label\\\":\\\"Impersonating Account/Website\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_fake_account_url_placeholder\\\":\\\"If there are multiple, separate them with spaces\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_description_label\\\":\\\"Brief Description\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_attachments_label\\\":\\\"Additional Materials\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_submit_button\\\":\\\"Submit\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_transfer_empty_search_title\\\":\\\"Network Not Found\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_transfer_empty_search_hint\\\":\\\"Enter \\\\\\\"{searchChain}\\\\\\\" as the transfer network?\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_transfer_empty_search_button\\\":\\\"Enter\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_sidebar_title\\\":\\\"Scam Identification and Prevention\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_sidebar_content1\\\":\\\"Be aware of common scams involving investment transfers.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_sidebar_content2\\\":\\\"Use MEXC Verify to check identities and detect impersonation scams.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_attachments_error_max_count\\\":\\\"You may upload up to 10 files.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_attachments_error_not_support_types\\\":\\\"Only JPG, JPEG, or PNG formats are supported.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_attachments_error_max_size\\\":\\\"Each file must not exceed 10 MB.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_attachments_upload_hint1_text1\\\":\\\"1. Screenshots or copies of chats or email correspondence with the individual or group involved.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_attachments_upload_hint1_text2\\\":\\\"2. Any screenshots or supporting documents related to requests for funds, assets, or operational instructions connected to the misconduct.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_attachments_upload_hint1_text3\\\":\\\"3. Relevant payment or transfer details, such as crypto addresses, account information, or TxID.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_attachments_upload_hint1_text4\\\":\\\"4. Screenshots of the account IDs used by the individual or group to contact you.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_attachments_upload_button\\\":\\\"Upload or paste them here\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_attachments_upload_hint2_text1\\\":\\\"• You may upload up to 10 files.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_attachments_upload_hint2_text2\\\":\\\"• Each file must not exceed 10 MB and only JPG, JPEG, or PNG formats are supported.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_description_hint1\\\":\\\"Please describe the incident in as much detail as possible. For example:\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_description_hint2\\\":\\\"1. The false pretext or method used by the individual or group (e.g., investment scam, impersonation, fake shopping, or other inducement tactics).\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_description_hint3\\\":\\\"2. How you came into contact with the individual or group involved.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_description_hint4\\\":\\\"3. Any promises, incentives, or benefits offered to you by the other party during the incident.\\\",\\\"mc_report_fraud_Xleads_form_description_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please describe the incident in as much detail as possible.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_new_reply\\\":\\\"New reply\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_finished\\\":\\\"Resolved\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_handling_tooltip\\\":\\\"We've received your ticket and are working on it. You can expect an update within 48 hours.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_new_reply_tooltip\\\":\\\"There's an update on your issue. Please check and respond.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_status_finished_tooltip\\\":\\\"Your issue has been resolved. If you need further assistance, we're here to help.\\\",\\\"mc_account_deletion_failed_financial_asset\\\":\\\"You have holdings in your Earn account\\\",\\\"mc_apply_clearance_step_reject\\\":\\\"Review Failed\\\",\\\"mc_apply_clearance_filled_date_mismatch\\\":\\\"The date on your application doesn't match today's date. Update and resubmit.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_clearance_filled_id_mismatch\\\":\\\"The ID you entered doesn't match the uploaded document. Update and resubmit.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_clearance_filled_uid_mismatch\\\":\\\"The MEXC UID you entered doesn't match this account's UID. Update and resubmit.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_clearance_kyc_completed\\\":\\\"You've completed KYC verification and can withdraw directly. No appeal needed.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_clearance_reject_reason\\\":\\\"Reason for rejection:\\\",\\\"mc_apply_clearance_reject_comment\\\":\\\"Reviewer's Note:\\\",\\\"mc_apply_clearance_apply_cancel\\\":\\\"Cancel Application\\\",\\\"mc_apply_clearance_apply_cancel_confirm_button\\\":\\\"Confirm Cancelation\\\",\\\"mc_apply_clearance_apply_cancel_desc\\\":\\\"Your application is still in progress. Cancel anyway?\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_urgent_toast_count_exceeded\\\":\\\"Expedite limit reached\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_urgent_toast_interval_not_met\\\":\\\"Expedite request too frequent\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_urgent_toast_priority\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Express Channel\\\\\\\" activated. Review specialists have been notified of your request and will prioritize your case.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_urgent_toast_express\\\":\\\"Your expedited request has been received. Your review has been prioritized and is expected to be completed within {time} hours.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_urgent_submitted_alert\\\":\\\"Your request is being expedited and should be completed within {hour} hours\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_urgent_submit\\\":\\\"Expedite Now\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_urgent_submit_expediting\\\":\\\"Expediting\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_record_modal_need_to_resubmit_tag\\\":\\\"Please resubmit information\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_record_modal_wait_supplement_data_item_tag\\\":\\\"Pending Additional Items\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_under_risk_analysis_tag\\\":\\\"Risk Analysis in Progress\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_data_review_estimated_time\\\":\\\"Estimated Completion Time:\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_audit_pass_notice\\\":\\\"Review approved. Due to risk control measures, your account will enter a \\u003cb\\u003e{days}-day monitoring period\\u003c/b\\u003e. This ensures a comprehensive assessment and minimizes misidentification risks. Certain functions will be \\u003cb\\u003etemporarily restricted\\u003c/b\\u003e. Please \\u003cb\\u003econtact us at {time}\\u003c/b\\u003e to confirm the final assessment results.\\\\n\\\\nYou may return to this page to monitor the progress. Updates will also be sent via email and notifications.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_auditing_notice\\\":\\\"Submission successful. Our team expects to complete the review within \\u003cb\\u003e{num} business days\\u003c/b\\u003e.\\\\n\\\\n\\u003cb\\u003eYou may return to this page to monitor the progress. Updates will also be sent via email and notifications.\\u003c/b\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_audit_pass_tip\\\":\\\"\\u003cb\\u003ePlease note:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe duration above is for reference only and is based on the current risk analysis.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\\\n\\u003cli\\u003eIn exceptional circumstances, your account status may change. Please refer to your account for the latest status. Contact Customer Service for assistance. \\u003c/li\\u003e\\\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_form_submit_success_tag\\\":\\\"Submitted successfully\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_data_review_predicted_complete_time\\\":\\\"Estimated Completion Time:\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_record_modal_aduiting_tag\\\":\\\"In Manual Review\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_data_review_status_not_pass\\\":\\\"Review not approved\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_data_review_complete_time\\\":\\\"Completion Time:\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_not_pass_title\\\":\\\"\\u003cb\\u003eYour documents did not pass the review.\\u003c/b\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_audit_not_pass_reason\\\":\\\"\\u003cb\\u003eReason for rejection: \\u003c/b\\u003e\\\\n\\u003cList\\u003e\\u003c/List\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_not_pass_notice\\\":\\\"\\u003cb\\u003ePlease adjust or supplement materials based on the reasons above, then click \\u003ca\\u003e\\\\\\\"Resubmit\\\\\\\"\\u003c/a\\u003e to re-apply.\\u003c/b\\u003e\\\\n\\\\nUpon resubmission, our team expects to finalize the review within \\u003cb\\u003e{num} business days\\u003c/b\\u003e.\\\\n\\\\nYou may return to this page to monitor the progress. Updates will also be sent via email and notifications.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_data_review_status_rejected\\\":\\\"Rejected\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_finished_title\\\":\\\"\\u003cb\\u003eThe review process is completed.\\u003c/b\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_finished_result\\\":\\\"Results:\\\\n\\u003cList\\u003e\\u003c/List\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_finished_footnote\\\":\\\"This is the final result based on the review team's comprehensive assessment. Thank you for your cooperation and understanding during this process.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_supplementary_alert_title\\\":\\\"\\u003cb\\u003eAdditional information is required for review.\\u003c/b\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_supplementary_notice\\\":\\\"To ensure an accurate assessment, \\u003cb\\u003eclick \\u003ca\\u003e\\\\\\\"Submit Additional Documents\\\\\\\"\\u003c/a\\u003e below to view requirements and upload the required materials\\u003c/b\\u003e.\\\\n\\\\nUpon resubmission, our team expects to finalize the review within \\u003cb\\u003e{num} business days\\u003c/b\\u003e.\\\\n\\\\nYou may return to this page to monitor the progress. Updates will also be sent via email and notifications.\\\",\\\"mc_common_remark\\\":\\\"Notes\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_type\\\":\\\"Ticket Type\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_submit_success_guest\\\":\\\"Ticket submitted. Please check your email for progress updates.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_code_sent_success\\\":\\\"Sent\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_recive_email\\\":\\\"Inbox\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_email_title\\\":\\\"Enter your email address\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_email_placeholder\\\":\\\"To receive ticket updates and follow-ups\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_verify_email_label\\\":\\\"A verification code will be sent to {email} and will be valid for 15 minutes\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_verify_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter verification code\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_get_now\\\":\\\"Get Code\\\",\\\"mc_common_requests_title\\\":\\\"Report a Problem | MEXC\\\",\\\"mc_common_requests_description\\\":\\\"If you come across any problems while using MEXC, you can submit a ticket here. We will promptly respond to you via email.\\\",\\\"mc_common_report_title\\\":\\\"Report Abnormal Funds | MEXC\\\",\\\"mc_common_report_description\\\":\\\"Ensure the safety of your assets by reporting abnormal funds on MEXC. Quick, confidential process to protect your account and contribute to a secure trading environment.\\\",\\\"mc_common_legal_title\\\":\\\"MEXC Law Enforcement Online Request System\\\",\\\"mc_common_legal_description\\\":\\\"MEXC's dedicated portal for law enforcement agencies to submit legal requests. Ensuring compliance and cooperation with legal standards in cryptocurrency trading.\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_action\\\":\\\"Action\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_activity_link\\\":\\\"Event Link\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_activity_link_placeholder\\\":\\\"Paste the link to the event page you're viewing\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_activity_name\\\":\\\"Event Name\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_activity_name_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter the event name or key details\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_activity_not_found\\\":\\\"No Matching Event Found\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_activity_reward_query\\\":\\\"Select a lookup type\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_activity_type\\\":\\\"Event Type\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_auto_query_after_select\\\":\\\"Once selected, we'll automatically retrieve your registered event details\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_click_upload\\\":\\\"Upload\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_completion_time\\\":\\\"Completed on\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_confirm_activity_type_hint\\\":\\\"Make sure the selected event type matches the one you registered for\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_confirm_submit_review\\\":\\\"Submit for Review?\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_event_id\\\":\\\"Event ID: \\u003cspan\\u003e{eventId}\\u003c/span\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_event_id_label\\\":\\\"Event ID\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_faq\\\":\\\"Event FAQ\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_fill_activity_info\\\":\\\"Enter Event Details\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_go_select_activity_type\\\":\\\"Select Event Type\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_loading\\\":\\\"Loading\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_manual_help_hint\\\":\\\"If you still can't find it, submit the details below for manual assistance\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_manual_query_delay_tip\\\":\\\"Manual review results may take up to 2 days. We appreciate your patience.\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_manual_review_result\\\":\\\"Review Result\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_no_reward_found\\\":\\\"No reward information found. Check the event page to confirm task completion.\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_no_reward_status_hint\\\":\\\"Reward status is currently unavailable. Submit a review request for assistance.\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_no_submission_record\\\":\\\"No submissions yet\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_only_reward_type_supported\\\":\\\"(Currently supports reward-related queries only)\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_other\\\":\\\"Other\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_problem_type\\\":\\\"Lookup Type\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_query_limit_tip\\\":\\\"Lookup is limited to events that you registered within the past 3 months.\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_query_registered_activity\\\":\\\"Registered Event Lookup\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_record_completed\\\":\\\"Completed ({num})\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_record_processing\\\":\\\"In Progress ({num})\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reject_reason\\\":\\\"Reason for Rejection\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_remark\\\":\\\"Comment:\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_review_completed\\\":\\\"Reviewed\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_review_pending\\\":\\\"Pending Review\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_review_revoked\\\":\\\"Canceled\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_revoke_application\\\":\\\"Cancel Request\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_revoked_hint\\\":\\\"You have withdrawn your request\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_center\\\":\\\"Rewards Hub\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_distributed\\\":\\\"Distributed\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_distributed_hint\\\":\\\"Distributed: For airdrops, bonuses, or fee vouchers, check your \\u003cassets\\u003eAssets\\u003c/assets\\u003e. For other vouchers, go to \\u003cvoucher\\u003eProfile → Voucher Center\\u003c/voucher\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_failed\\\":\\\"Rejected\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_pending\\\":\\\"Pending\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_pending_hint\\\":\\\"Pending: Rewards will be distributed within 14 days after the event ends\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_record_screenshot\\\":\\\"Reward Record Screenshot\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_rejected_fcfs_hint\\\":\\\"Rejected: Distributed on a first-come, first-served basis. All rewards allocated.\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_rejected_overlap_hint\\\":\\\"Rejected: Multiple participation detected; rewards restricted to a single issuance per rule.\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_rejected_risk_hint\\\":\\\"Rejected: Risk control protocols triggered; reward eligibility not met. The decision is final.\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_source\\\":\\\"Source\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_status\\\":\\\"Status\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_status_value\\\":\\\"Reward Status: {status}\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_time\\\":\\\"Distributed on\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_within_14_days\\\":\\\"Rewards will be distributed within 14 days\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_screenshot_guide\\\":\\\"Check the event page for your task and reward records\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_select_activity_type_placeholder\\\":\\\"Select an event type\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_select_activity_type_tip\\\":\\\"Select the event type you have successfully registered for to ensure accurate results\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_status_abandoned\\\":\\\"Canceled\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_status_ended\\\":\\\"Ended\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_status_in_progress\\\":\\\"Ongoing\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_status_not_started\\\":\\\"Coming Soon\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_status_settling\\\":\\\"Pending Settlement\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_submission_record\\\":\\\"Submission History\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_submit_detail\\\":\\\"Submission Details\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_submit_review\\\":\\\"Submit for Review\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_submit_review_wait_hint\\\":\\\"Upon submission, we will verify your event reward information within 2 days. Thank you for your patience.\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_submit_success\\\":\\\"Submitted successfully\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_submit_time\\\":\\\"Submitted on\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_supplementary_materials\\\":\\\"Additional Information\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_task_completion_screenshot\\\":\\\"Task Completion Screenshot\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_task_incomplete_hint\\\":\\\"Not Eligible: Task not completed\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_title\\\":\\\"Event Assistant\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_upload_activity_screenshot\\\":\\\"Upload relevant event screenshots\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_upload_file_count_limit\\\":\\\"Upload up to {num} files\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_upload_file_limit\\\":\\\"Upload up to {num} files per section\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_upload_file_size_limit\\\":\\\"Each file must be under {num} MB. Supported formats: JPG, JPEG, PNG\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_upload_or_paste_here\\\":\\\"Upload or paste here\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_view_button\\\":\\\"View {button}\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_view_detail\\\":\\\"View Details\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_warm_tips\\\":\\\"Reminder\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_name\\\":\\\"Reward Name\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_revoke_success\\\":\\\"Canceled\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_activity_status\\\":\\\"Event Status\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_review_status\\\":\\\"Review Status\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_activity_not_found_submit_tip\\\":\\\"If no relevant event is found, please provide the event details. We will prioritize verifying the event status and reward distribution.\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_review_result_email_tip\\\":\\\"The review results will be sent to your registered email address\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_reply_retract_confirm_title\\\":\\\"Recall Message\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_reply_retract_confirm_content\\\":\\\"Recall this message? Once recalled, its content cannot be recovered.\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_reply_retract_confirm_ok\\\":\\\"Recall\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_reply_retract_confirm_cancel\\\":\\\"Cancel\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_reply_retracted\\\":\\\"Recall\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_reply_agent_retracted\\\":\\\"This message has been recalled\\\",\\\"mc_ticket_reply_user_retracted\\\":\\\"You recalled a message\\\",\\\"mc_common_loading\\\":\\\"Loading...\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_time_range_week\\\":\\\"Recent {num} Week(s)\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_time_range_month\\\":\\\"Recent {num} Month(s)\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_time_range_year\\\":\\\"Recent {num} Year(s)\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_error_unsupport_coin_deposit_to_hot_wallet\\\":\\\"The deposit address is a MEXC hot wallet address and the token {depositCrypto}-{walletType} is not supported by MEXC. Due to security reasons, this request cannot be processed at this time. Should the token be listed in the future, please contact us for further assistance.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_error_unsupport_coin_deposit_to_other_hot_wallet\\\":\\\"{depositCrypto}-{walletType} was deposited to {depositAddress}. Due to security reasons, we are unable to process such requests. We strongly recommend verifying the address and network before depositing to avoid asset loss.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_error_deposit_to_other_user_address\\\":\\\"The deposit address does not belong to your account. Please check if the address is entered correctly.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_error_deposit_to_dex_address\\\":\\\"We regret to inform you that this token is currently not supported for DEX+ trading and cannot be returned. The assets remain at your address; you may resume trading once more liquidity pools are integrated in the future.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_error_deposit_insufficient_confirmations\\\":\\\"The block confirmations for this transaction have not yet met the required number of confirmations. Please wait for further on-chain confirmations.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_error_deposit_channel_closed\\\":\\\"The deposit channel of {depositCrypto}-{walletType} is currently closed. Your assets can only be processed once the channel reopens. Please wait patiently. \\u003ca\\u003eView deposit and withdrawal status\\u003c/a\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_error_forced_deposit_auto_refunded\\\":\\\"MEXC does not support this token. The unsupported deposit has been automatically returned. Please go to Deposit History to view the return details.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_error_forced_deposit_cannot_auto_refund\\\":\\\"MEXC does not support this token. While it could be returned to the original address, the on-chain gas fees exceed the deposit amount, making the return impossible. Please ensure the deposit channel is open before transferring to avoid asset loss.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_cancel_apply\\\":\\\"Cancel Request\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_cancel_apply_confirm_title\\\":\\\"Cancel Risk Review Request\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_cancel_apply_confirm_content\\\":\\\"Your request is under review and is expected to be completed within {num} business days. If you cancel, your submitted documents will no longer be retained. To address account restrictions later, submit a new request.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_cancel_apply_wait\\\":\\\"Maybe Later\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_reason_tags_label\\\":\\\"Risk Reason\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_record_modal_cancel_tag\\\":\\\"Request Canceled\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_auditing_cancel_apply_notice\\\":\\\"Request canceled. To address account restrictions later, submit a new request.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_ai_audit_pre_auditing\\\":\\\"Pre-screening your documents. Do not close this page.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_ai_audit_pass\\\":\\\"Verification passed. Redirecting now...\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_ai_audit_completed\\\":\\\"Verification failed. Please modify your documents based on the results.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_ai_audit_modal_title\\\":\\\"Document Pre-screening\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_ai_audit_countdown\\\":\\\"\\u003cseconds\\u003e{num}\\u003c/seconds\\u003e\\u003cunit\\u003es\\u003c/unit\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_ai_audit_back_to_edit\\\":\\\"Edit\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_ai_audit_item_pass\\\":\\\"Passed\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_ai_audit_item_fail_prefix\\\":\\\"Failed: {reason}\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_close_confirm_title\\\":\\\"Notice\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_close_confirm_desc\\\":\\\"Face verification is incomplete. Go back and complete it to continue.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_close_confirm_ok\\\":\\\"OK\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_close_confirm_exit\\\":\\\"Exit\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_verify_success_title\\\":\\\"Verification Successful\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_verify_failed_title\\\":\\\"Verification Failed\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_verify_waiting_title\\\":\\\"Waiting for Result\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_verify_continue\\\":\\\"Continue\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_verify_retry\\\":\\\"Verify Again\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_verify_success_content\\\":\\\"Verification successful. Click Continue to finish submitting your documents.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_verify_failed_content\\\":\\\"Face verification failed. Verify again to continue.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_aai_verify_waiting_desc_with_time\\\":\\\"Your verification result will be available within \\u003cspan1\\u003e{amountTime}\\u003c/span1\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_choose_reason_tip_time_default\\\":\\\"Supports exporting historical data from the past {num}years (earliest available from October 1, 2024).\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_time_range_day\\\":\\\"Past {num} days\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_form_common_tip_time_default\\\":\\\"Each report supports the export of up to {num} years of historical data (earliest available from October 1, 2024).\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_additional_fee_notice_2\\\":\\\"The asset value must exceed the processing fee. If the value is below this threshold, careful consideration is strongly advised before submission.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_additional_recovery_address_title_2\\\":\\\"Enter return address\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_additional_recovery_address_prompt_1\\\":\\\"Your assets will be returned to this address. Please ensure the address matches the network. \\u003cspan\\u003eReturn Network: {network}\\u003c/span\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_additional_recovery_address_prompt_2\\\":\\\"Please ensure the return address is valid and correct. MEXC shall not be held liable for any loss of funds resulting from an incorrect address.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_withdraw_txid\\\":\\\"Withdrawal TxID\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_hash_format_error_1\\\":\\\"The deposit TxID format does not match the selected network. Please check and try again.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_withdraw_txid_min_length_hint\\\":\\\"Invalid withdrawal TxID. Please try again.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_withdraw_txid_error_1\\\":\\\"No matched withdrawal record found. Please check the TxID and try again.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_refund_hash_format_error_1\\\":\\\"The return TxID format does not match the selected network. Please check and try again.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_refund_network\\\":\\\"Please fill in the return network strictly based on the transaction hash (TxID/TxHash). \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/br\\u003eIf you are unsure, please contact the sending platform for confirmation.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_refund_chain\\\":\\\"Return Network (e.g., ERC20)\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_refund_chain_placeholder\\\":\\\"Select the network used for the asset return to verify the transaction details\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_refund_address_hint\\\":\\\"Please enter the receiving address displayed in the return transaction hash (TxID/TxHash). \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/br\\u003eThe receiving address is commonly referred to as the \\\\\\\"To Address\\\\\\\" or \\\\\\\"Receiver Address\\\\\\\".\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_refund_address\\\":\\\"Return Address\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_refund_address_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter the address to receive the returned assets\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_refund_hash_min_length_hint\\\":\\\"Invalid return TxID. Please try again.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_withdraw_txid_popover\\\":\\\"The withdrawal TxID is the transaction hash of your transfer from MEXC to an external address. You can find it in your withdrawal history. Please copy and paste the full TxID here.\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_withdraw_txid_placeholder\\\":\\\"Copy the TxID from your MEXC withdrawal history and paste it here\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_refund_coin\\\":\\\"Returned Crypto (e.g., BTC)\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_refund_coin_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter the exact crypto name to verify the return information\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_refund_count\\\":\\\"Return Amount\\\",\\\"mc_deposit_recovery_refund_count_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter return amount\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_tips_banner_intro\\\":\\\"To protect your account and trading experience, the system will require account security verification when unusual activity or potential risk is detected, in accordance with Article 2 of \\u003ca1\\u003eMEXC User Verification\\u003c/a1\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_futures_open_q\\\":\\\"Why can't I open Futures positions?\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_futures_open_a\\\":\\\"To protect your account and trading experience, the system will temporarily restrict Futures position opening when verification is triggered. See Article 2 of \\u003ca1\\u003eMEXC User Verification\\u003c/a1\\u003e for details. Withdrawals are not affected during verification. After you complete verification, the system will review it within 5 to 10 minutes, and your Futures position opening will be restored automatically.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_fee_changed_q\\\":\\\"Why did my Futures trading fees change?\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_fee_changed_a\\\":\\\"To protect your account and trading experience, the system will temporarily adjust your Futures fees when verification is triggered. See Article 2 of \\u003ca1\\u003eMEXC User Verification\\u003c/a1\\u003e for details. Withdrawals are not affected during verification. After you complete verification, the system will review it within 5 to 10 minutes, and your Futures fees will be restored automatically.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_zero_fee_q\\\":\\\"Why can't I access 0-fee benefits after verification?\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_zero_fee_a\\\":\\\"To maintain a fair and secure trading environment, MEXC dynamically adjusts fee rates based on factors such as account trading behavior and risk assessments. As a result, some accounts may still be ineligible for 0-fee benefits after verification. Please refer to the \\u003ca1\\u003etrading fee rate\\u003c/a1\\u003e displayed in your account for the actual rate.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_leverage_limit_q\\\":\\\"Why is my maximum Futures leverage limited?\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_leverage_limit_a\\\":\\\"To protect your account and trading experience, the system will temporarily lower your maximum available Futures leverage when verification is triggered. The actual limit is subject to the page display. See Article 2 of \\u003ca1\\u003eMEXC User Verification\\u003c/a1\\u003e for details. Withdrawals are not affected during verification. After you complete verification, the system will review it within 5 to 10 minutes, and your maximum leverage will be restored automatically.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_open_amount_limit_q\\\":\\\"Why is my maximum Futures position-opening amount limited?\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_open_amount_limit_a\\\":\\\"To protect your account and trading experience, the system will temporarily lower the maximum amount you can use to open Futures positions when verification is triggered. The actual limit is subject to the page display. See Article 2 of \\u003ca1\\u003eMEXC User Verification\\u003c/a1\\u003e for details. Withdrawals are not affected during verification. After you complete verification, the system will review it within 5 to 10 minutes, and your opening amount limit will be restored automatically.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_pair_blocked_q\\\":\\\"Why can't I view some Futures pairs?\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_pair_blocked_a\\\":\\\"To protect your account and trading experience, the system will temporarily restrict access to some Futures pairs when verification is triggered. See Article 2 of \\u003ca1\\u003eMEXC User Verification\\u003c/a1\\u003e for details. Withdrawals are not affected during verification. After you complete verification, the system will review it within 5 to 10 minutes, and restricted Futures pairs will be displayed again automatically.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_order_frequency_limit_q\\\":\\\"Why is my Futures position-opening frequency limited?\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_order_frequency_limit_a\\\":\\\"To protect your account and trading experience, the system will temporarily limit how often you can open Futures positions when verification is triggered. See Article 2 of \\u003ca1\\u003eMEXC User Verification\\u003c/a1\\u003e for details. Withdrawals are not affected during verification. After you complete verification, the system will review it within 5 to 10 minutes, and your Futures position-opening frequency will be restored automatically.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_recovery_time_q\\\":\\\"When will restricted features be restored after verification?\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_recovery_time_a\\\":\\\"The system will complete the review within 5 to 10 minutes, and restricted features will be restored automatically. Refresh the page or log in again later.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_verify_failed_q\\\":\\\"What should I do if verification fails or times out?\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_verify_failed_a\\\":\\\"If verification fails, times out, or the page doesn't load properly, try refreshing the page, logging in again, or switching to a more stable network. If you still can't complete verification after multiple attempts, contact MEXC Customer Service for help.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_advanced_kyc_trigger_q\\\":\\\"Why am I still asked to verify after completing Advanced KYC?\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_advanced_kyc_trigger_a\\\":\\\"Advanced KYC verifies your identity, while MEXC User Verification assesses the risk of each action and operating environment. These are separate protection mechanisms. To reduce potential risks to your account, the system starts verification when unusual activity is detected. This mechanism does not target specific users. For details, see \\u003ca1\\u003eMEXC User Verification\\u003c/a1\\u003e.\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_personal_kyc_title\\\":\\\"KYC Verification\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_tips_banner_label\\\":\\\"Reminder\\\",\\\"mc_rc_security_verification_faq_title\\\":\\\"FAQ\\\",\\\"mc_apply_claims_go_home_page\\\":\\\"Visit MEXC Homepage\\\",\\\"mc_apply_claims_record_modal_apply_info\\\":\\\"Application Details\\\",\\\"mc_apply_claims_record_modal_apply_number\\\":\\\"Service Ticket Number\\\",\\\"mc_apply_claims_email\\\":\\\"Email\\\",\\\"mc_apply_claims_back_button\\\":\\\"Back\\\",\\\"mc_apply_claims_apply_form_person_info\\\":\\\"Personal Details\\\",\\\"mc_apply_claims_file_uploading\\\":\\\"Files are still uploading, please submit after the upload is complete.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_claims_upload_file_error_number\\\":\\\"Only a maximum of {number} attachments can be uploaded. Please select again.\\\",\\\"mc_apply_claims_upload_photo_hint\\\":\\\"Only files in {type} format under {size} MB are supported\\\",\\\"mc_apply_claims_record_view_detail\\\":\\\"View Details\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_tab_sub_account\\\":\\\"Sub-Account\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_contract_grid_trading\\\":\\\"Futures Grid Trading\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_sub_account_spot_trades\\\":\\\"Spot trade history\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_sub_account_futures_trades\\\":\\\"Futures trade history\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_sub_account_transfers\\\":\\\"Sub-account transfer records\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_record_pending_review\\\":\\\"Pending review\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_record_email_sent\\\":\\\"Sent to email\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_record_unsupported_export_type\\\":\\\"Unsupported data type for export\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_form_sub_account_tip\\\":\\\"You can export sub-account data up to 10 times per month.\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_bind_email_modal_title\\\":\\\"Reminder\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_bind_email_bind_link\\\":\\\"Link Now\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_bind_email_modal_tip_1\\\":\\\"1. The export result will be sent to your email.\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_bind_email_modal_tip_2\\\":\\\"2. Please \\u003cstrong\\u003e link your email \\u003c/strong\\u003e  first so we can send the export file to you.\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_special_user_export_modal_content\\\":\\\"Due to the large volume of data, it may take up to \\u003cstrong\\u003e{day} day(s)\\u003c/strong\\u003e for the email to be sent.\\\",\\\"mc_data_export_sub_account_select_error_required\\\":\\\"Select sub-account\\\",\\\"mc_apply_claim_resubmit\\\":\\\"Resubmit\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_breadcrumb_self_service\\\":\\\"Self-Service\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_breadcrumb_title\\\":\\\"Account Recovery\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_email_code_error\\\":\\\"Incorrect verification code\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_email_code_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter email verification code\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_email_confirm\\\":\\\"Confirm\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_email_fill_desc\\\":\\\"Make sure this email can receive messages. We will send the result to this address.\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_email_fill_title\\\":\\\"Enter Email\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_email_format_error\\\":\\\"Invalid email format\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_email_get_code\\\":\\\"Get Code\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_email_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter email\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_email_send_success\\\":\\\"Sent\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_click_upload\\\":\\\"Click to Upload\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_fund_proof_hint\\\":\\\"Upload a video showing the source of funds for one or more deposits to this account. The video must show the corresponding withdrawal record on the source platform.\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_fund_proof_label\\\":\\\"4. Proof of Fund Source\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_fund_proof_requirement\\\":\\\"Clearly show the token, network, withdrawal TxID, withdrawal amount, and withdrawal date and time\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_fund_proof_step1\\\":\\\"Start recording from the homepage of your source platform account\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_fund_proof_step2\\\":\\\"From the homepage, go to Withdrawal History and show one withdrawal record to MEXC\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_fund_proof_step3\\\":\\\"Open the withdrawal details page, clearly show details such as the token, amount, withdrawal address, and withdrawal TxID, and stay on the page for a few seconds\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_fund_proof_step4\\\":\\\"Stop recording and upload the video here\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_fund_proof_steps_title\\\":\\\"Instructions:\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_id_number_hint\\\":\\\"Make sure the ID number matches the ID document held in the video\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_id_number_label\\\":\\\"1. ID Number\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_id_number_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter ID number\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_id_photo_hint\\\":\\\"Submit the original ID document or take a photo with your camera. Edited images are not supported.\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_id_photo_label\\\":\\\"2. ID Photos\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_id_video_hint\\\":\\\"When recording, show your face and hold your ID while reading the script below. Make sure the video and audio are clear.\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_id_video_label\\\":\\\"3. Selfie Video with ID\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_id_video_script\\\":\\\"Script: \\\\\\\"Today is [YYYY-MM-DD]. I can't remember my MEXC account information and am applying to recover my account.\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_image_clear_hint\\\":\\\"Make sure all details are clear and legible\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_image_format_hint\\\":\\\"Only JPG, JPEG, and PNG images are supported\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_image_size_hint\\\":\\\"Max image size: {number} MB\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_image_upload_error\\\":\\\"Files must be JPG, JPEG, or PNG and no larger than {number} MB\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_submit\\\":\\\"Submit\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_title\\\":\\\"Fill in Required Details\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_txid_label\\\":\\\"5. TxID from Proof of Fund Source\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_txid_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter TxID\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_form_video_upload_error\\\":\\\"Videos must be MP4, AVI, or MOV and no larger than {number} MB\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_approved_account\\\":\\\"Account {index}: \\u003cspan\\u003e{accountInfo}\\u003c/span\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_approved_desc\\\":\\\"For your account security, only masked information is shown\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_approved_status\\\":\\\"Approved\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_login\\\":\\\"Log In\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_progress_title\\\":\\\"Review Progress\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_reapply\\\":\\\"Reapply\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_rejected_desc\\\":\\\"Review the rejection reason and submit a new application:\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_rejected_status\\\":\\\"Rejected\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_remark\\\":\\\"Note:\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_reviewing_desc\\\":\\\"Review will be completed by {time}. Thank you for your patience.\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_reviewing_email_hint\\\":\\\"Updates and results will be sent to your contact email\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_reviewing_status\\\":\\\"Under Review\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_revoke\\\":\\\"Cancel Application\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_revoked_desc\\\":\\\"You canceled your account recovery application on {time}\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_result_revoked_status\\\":\\\"Canceled\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_revoke_modal_confirm\\\":\\\"Cancel Application\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_revoke_modal_continue\\\":\\\"Continue Review\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_revoke_modal_desc\\\":\\\"You will need to fill out the application again after canceling\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_revoke_modal_title\\\":\\\"Cancel Application?\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_step_apply\\\":\\\"Start Application\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_step_review_result\\\":\\\"Review Result\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_step_submit_materials\\\":\\\"Submit Documents\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_submitted_desc\\\":\\\"Your application has been submitted. We will prioritize your request and send the result to {email}.\\\",\\\"mc_support_find_account_submitted_title\\\":\\\"Submitted Successfully\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_activity_link_invalid\\\":\\\"Enter an event link starting with \\u003cspan\\u003ehttps://\\u003c/span\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_support_event_assistant_reward_pending_event_ended\\\":\\\"Distribution Pending: Event Ended\\\",\\\"mc_insights_disclaimer\\\":\\\"Content is sourced from licensed news outlets, publicly available information, and AI-generated or rewritten materials. It is for reference only and does not constitute investment advice. Accuracy and timeliness are not guaranteed. You assume all risks associated with using this content, and MEXC is not liable for any resulting loss. Relevant copyrights belong to the original sources. Contact us to request removal.\\\",\\\"mc_insights_related_news\\\":\\\"Related News\\\",\\\"mc_insights_prediction_markets\\\":\\\"Prediction Markets\\\",\\\"mc_insights_hours_ago\\\":\\\"{time}h ago\\\",\\\"mc_insights_minutes_ago\\\":\\\"{time}m ago\\\",\\\"mc_insights_news\\\":\\\"News\\\",\\\"mc_insights_twitter\\\":\\\"X\\\",\\\"mc_insights_whale_alert\\\":\\\"Whale Alert\\\",\\\"mc_insights_alpaca_news\\\":\\\"Alpaca News\\\",\\\"mc_insights_panews\\\":\\\"PANews\\\",\\\"mc_insights_jinse_finance\\\":\\\"Jinse Finance\\\",\\\"mc_insights_benzinga\\\":\\\"Benzinga\\\",\\\"mc_insights_mexc_news\\\":\\\"MEXC News\\\",\\\"mc_insights_share_time\\\":\\\"Shared on {value}\\\",\\\"mc_share_footer_title_v2\\\":\\\"Sign up for $10,000 in rewards and enjoy zero-fee trading!\\\",\\\"mc_community_ka-GE\\\":\\\"Georgian\\\",\\\"mc_community_mn-MN\\\":\\\"Mongolian\\\",\\\"mc_community_sr-RS\\\":\\\"Serbian\\\",\\\"mc_community_cnr-ME\\\":\\\"Montenegrin\\\",\\\"mc_community_sq-AL\\\":\\\"Albanian\\\",\\\"mc_community_mk-MK\\\":\\\"Macedonian\\\",\\\"mc_apply_risk_control_to_application_record\\\":\\\"Check Application History\\\",\\\"mc_apply