ion. Our team will review your project based on the provided details.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/br\\u003eUpon successful review, our Business Development team will contact you. Verify the authenticity of our team through the official verification link: \\u003ca\\u003ehttps://www.mexc.com/official-verify\\u003c/a\\u003e before communication. Thank you.\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_progress_label_project_info\\\":\\\"Project Information\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_progress_label_personal_info\\\":\\\"Personal Information\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_progress_label_team_info\\\":\\\"Team Information\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_error_above_submission_limit\\\":\\\"You have reached the maximum daily submission limit. Please submit again tomorrow.\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_too_often\\\":\\\"This project has been submitted too often. Try again later.\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_btn_prev\\\":\\\"Previous\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_btn_next\\\":\\\"Next\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_btn_submit\\\":\\\"Submit\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_success_header\\\":\\\"Submission Received!\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_success_body\\\":\\\"Thank you for your submission. Your project is under review.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/br\\u003e\\\\nUpon approval, our business development team will contact you soon. Thank you!\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_btn_to_home\\\":\\\"Back to Home\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_label_project_name\\\":\\\"Project Name\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_label_token_name\\\":\\\"Token/Crypto Symbol\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_label_project_desc\\\":\\\"Project Description\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_label_project_web_link\\\":\\\"Project Official Website Link\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_label_official_twi_link\\\":\\\"Official X Account\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_label_smart_contract_link\\\":\\\"Smart Contract/Block Explorer Link\\\",\\\"mc_token_listing_apply_label_listed_platform\\\":\\\"Listed Exchange Platforms\\\",\\\"mc_